Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.39,0:00:55.39,ENG,1,0,0,0,,Once upon a time
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.39,0:00:57.38,ENG,2,0,0,0,,in a kingdom far, far away,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.19,0:01:01.58,ENG,3,0,0,0,,the king and queen were blessed with a beautiful baby girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.79,0:01:05.38,ENG,4,0,0,0,,And throughout the land, everyone was happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.39,0:01:07.89,ENG,5,0,0,0,,until the sun went down
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.19,0:01:12.19,ENG,6,0,0,0,,and they saw that their daughter was cursed with a frightful enchantment
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.30,0:01:15.29,ENG,7,0,0,0,,that took hold each and every night.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.89,0:01:20.19,ENG,8,0,0,0,,Desperate, they sought the help of a fairy godmother
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.79,0:01:23.49,ENG,9,0,0,0,,who had them lock the young princess away in a tower,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.49,0:01:25.69,ENG,10,0,0,0,,there to await the kiss...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.99,0:01:28.20,ENG,11,0,0,0,,of the handsome Prince Charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.40,0:01:33.59,ENG,12,0,0,0,,It was he who would chance the perilous journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.60,0:01:36.59,ENG,13,0,0,0,,through blistering cold and scorching desert
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.59,0:01:38.70,ENG,14,0,0,0,,traveling for many days and nights,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.70,0:01:40.19,ENG,15,0,0,0,,risking life and limb
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.19,0:01:44.99,ENG,16,0,0,0,,to reach the Dragon 's keep.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.70,0:01:49.70,ENG,17,0,0,0,,For he was the bravest,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.90,0:01:53.99,ENG,18,0,0,0,,and most handsome...in all the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.78,0:01:58.79,ENG,19,0,0,0,,And it was destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.20,0:02:00.49,ENG,20,0,0,0,,that
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.69,0:02:02.30,ENG,21,0,0,0,,his kiss
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.30,0:02:06.00,ENG,22,0,0,0,,would break the dreaded curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.29,0:02:08.29,ENG,23,0,0,0,,He alone would
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.70,0:02:11.80,ENG,24,0,0,0,,climb to the highest room of the tallest tower to enter the princess's chambers,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.00,0:02:16.00,ENG,25,0,0,0,,cross the room to her sleeping silhouette,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.20,0:02:19.41,ENG,26,0,0,0,,pull back the gossamer curtains to find her...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.20,0:02:22.20,ENG,27,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.30,0:02:24.70,ENG,28,0,0,0,,Princess... Fiona?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.89,0:02:25.60,ENG,29,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.79,0:02:27.80,ENG,30,0,0,0,,Oh, thank heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.00,0:02:29.19,ENG,31,0,0,0,,Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.19,0:02:29.90,ENG,32,0,0,0,,She's on her honeymoon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.19,0:02:32.69,ENG,33,0,0,0,,Honeymoon? With whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.59,0:02:50.10,ENG,34,0,0,0,,∮ So she said what's the problem, baby? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.10,0:02:51.90,ENG,35,0,0,0,,∮ What's the problem? I don't know ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.01,0:02:53.66,ENG,36,0,0,0,,∮ Well maybe I'm in love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.10,0:02:56.49,ENG,37,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.60,0:02:58.90,ENG,38,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.17,0:03:02.20,ENG,39,0,0,0,,∮ How much longer will it take to cure this? ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.20,0:03:04.89,ENG,40,0,0,0,,∮ Just to cure it, 'cause I can't ignore it ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.00,0:03:06.30,ENG,41,0,0,0,,∮ if it's love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.40,0:03:08.70,ENG,42,0,0,0,,∮ Makes me wanna turn around and face me ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.70,0:03:11.31,ENG,43,0,0,0,,∮ But I don't know nothing 'bout love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.40,0:03:13.21,ENG,44,0,0,0,,∮ Oh, come on, come on ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.31,0:03:15.50,ENG,45,0,0,0,,∮ Turn a little faster ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.60,0:03:17.10,ENG,46,0,0,0,,∮ Come on, come on ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.20,0:03:19.30,ENG,47,0,0,0,,∮ The world will follow after ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.30,0:03:20.81,ENG,48,0,0,0,,∮ Come on, come on ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.90,0:03:25.60,ENG,49,0,0,0,,∮ Everybody's after love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.00,0:03:33.60,ENG,50,0,0,0,,∮ So I said I'm a snowball running ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.70,0:03:37.49,ENG,51,0,0,0,,∮ Running down into this spring that's coming all this love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.60,0:03:41.00,ENG,52,0,0,0,,∮ Melting under blue skies ,Belting out sunlight ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.09,0:03:43.10,ENG,53,0,0,0,,∮ Shimmering love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.20,0:03:44.90,ENG,54,0,0,0,,∮ Well, baby, I surrender ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.00,0:03:47.11,ENG,55,0,0,0,,∮ To the strawberry ice cream ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.11,0:03:50.09,ENG,56,0,0,0,,∮ Never ever end of all this love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.20,0:03:52.10,ENG,57,0,0,0,,∮ Well, I didn't mean to do it ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.20,0:03:55.50,ENG,58,0,0,0,,∮ But there's no escaping your love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.19,0:04:00.40,ENG,59,0,0,0,,∮ These lines of lightning mean we're never alone ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.40,0:04:02.61,ENG,60,0,0,0,,∮ Never alone, no, no ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.71,0:04:04.31,ENG,61,0,0,0,,∮ Come on, come on ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.31,0:04:06.30,ENG,62,0,0,0,,∮ Jump a little higher ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.30,0:04:07.40,ENG,63,0,0,0,,∮ Come on, come on ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.40,0:04:09.70,ENG,64,0,0,0,,∮ If you feel a little lighter ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.81,0:04:11.01,ENG,65,0,0,0,,∮ Come on, come on ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.11,0:04:14.41,ENG,66,0,0,0,,∮ We were once upon a time in love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.71,0:04:21.40,ENG,67,0,0,0,,∮ We 're accidentally in love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.29,0:04:25.30,ENG,68,0,0,0,,∮ Accidentally in love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.80,0:04:29.09,ENG,69,0,0,0,,∮ Accidentally in love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.20,0:04:32.70,ENG,70,0,0,0,,∮ Accidentally in love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.79,0:04:36.11,ENG,71,0,0,0,,∮ Accidentally in love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.20,0:04:37.31,ENG,72,0,0,0,,∮ Accidentally in love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.31,0:04:39.71,ENG,73,0,0,0,,∮ Accidentally in love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.81,0:04:41.30,ENG,74,0,0,0,,∮ Accidentally ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.30,0:04:44.71,ENG,75,0,0,0,,∮ I'm in love, I'm in love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.80,0:04:46.61,ENG,76,0,0,0,,∮ I'm in love, I'm in love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.70,0:04:50.21,ENG,77,0,0,0,,∮ Accidentally ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.30,0:04:54.11,ENG,78,0,0,0,,∮ I'm in love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.21,0:04:56.01,ENG,79,0,0,0,,∮ I'm in love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.51,0:04:58.21,ENG,80,0,0,0,,It's so good to be home!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.22,0:05:03.61,ENG,81,0,0,0,,Just you and me and...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.81,0:05:10.80,ENG,82,0,0,0,,∮ Two can be as bad as one... ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.80,0:05:11.91,ENG,83,0,0,0,,Donkey?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.91,0:05:13.50,ENG,84,0,0,0,,Shrek! Fiona!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.50,0:05:15.51,ENG,85,0,0,0,,Aren't you two a sight for sore eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.51,0:05:16.31,ENG,86,0,0,0,,Give us a hug, Shrek,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.31,0:05:18.40,ENG,87,0,0,0,,you old love machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.40,0:05:20.91,ENG,88,0,0,0,,And look at you, Mrs. Shrek.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.91,0:05:22.61,ENG,89,0,0,0,,How 'bout a side of sugar for the steed?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.61,0:05:24.81,ENG,90,0,0,0,,Donkey, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.81,0:05:26.82,ENG,91,0,0,0,,Taking care of your love nest for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.91,0:05:29.41,ENG,92,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean like... sorting the mail
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.71,0:05:31.21,ENG,93,0,0,0,,and watering the plants?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.21,0:05:32.91,ENG,94,0,0,0,,Yeah, and feeding the fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.91,0:05:34.41,ENG,95,0,0,0,,I don't have any fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.41,0:05:35.41,ENG,96,0,0,0,,You do now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.50,0:05:37.31,ENG,97,0,0,0,,I call that one Shrek and the other Fiona.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.31,0:05:39.41,ENG,98,0,0,0,,That Shrek is a rascally devil. Get your...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.21,0:05:43.02,ENG,99,0,0,0,,Look at the time. I guess you'd better be going.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.02,0:05:44.52,ENG,100,0,0,0,,Don't you want to tell me about your trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.52,0:05:46.42,ENG,101,0,0,0,,Or how about a game of Parcheesi?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.22,0:05:51.92,ENG,102,0,0,0,,Actually, Donkey? Shouldn't you be getting home to Dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.22,0:05:54.12,ENG,103,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.21,0:05:56.52,ENG,104,0,0,0,,I don't know. She's been all moody and stuff lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.21,0:05:58.91,ENG,105,0,0,0,,I thought I'd move in with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.22,0:06:02.00,ENG,106,0,0,0,,You know we're always happy to see you, Donkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.00,0:06:04.61,ENG,107,0,0,0,,But Fiona and I are married now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.61,0:06:08.41,ENG,108,0,0,0,,We need a little time, you know, to be together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.30,0:06:11.70,ENG,109,0,0,0,,Just with each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.51,0:06:14.90,ENG,110,0,0,0,,Alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.90,0:06:16.22,ENG,111,0,0,0,,Say no more. Say no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.41,0:06:18.91,ENG,112,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry about a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.91,0:06:20.42,ENG,113,0,0,0,,I will always be here to make sure nobody bothers you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.51,0:06:21.21,ENG,114,0,0,0,,Donkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.21,0:06:22.21,ENG,115,0,0,0,,Yes, roomie?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.21,0:06:23.91,ENG,116,0,0,0,,You're bothering me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.81,0:06:26.82,ENG,117,0,0,0,,Oh, OK. All right,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.91,0:06:32.11,ENG,118,0,0,0,,cool. I guess...  Me and Pinocchio was going to catch a tournament, anyway, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.31,0:06:35.42,ENG,119,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll see y'all Sunday for a barbecue or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.51,0:06:41.42,ENG,120,0,0,0,,He'll be fine. Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.52,0:06:42.82,ENG,121,0,0,0,,where were we?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.91,0:06:46.11,ENG,122,0,0,0,,I think I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.12,0:06:49.81,ENG,123,0,0,0,,Donkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.81,0:06:53.21,ENG,124,0,0,0,,I know, I know! Alone! I'm going! I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.32,0:06:55.51,ENG,125,0,0,0,,What do you want me to tell these other guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.61,0:06:59.62,ENG,126,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.12,0:07:08.51,ENG,127,0,0,0,,Enough, Reggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.51,0:07:14.82,ENG,128,0,0,0,,"Dearest Princess Fiona.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.92,0:07:19.12,ENG,129,0,0,0,,"You are hereby summoned to the Kingdom of Far, Far Away
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.21,0:07:23.62,ENG,130,0,0,0,,"for a royal ball in celebration of your marriage
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.62,0:07:28.02,ENG,131,0,0,0,,"at which time the King will bestow his royal blessing...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.02,0:07:32.91,ENG,132,0,0,0,," upon you and your...uh... Prince Charming."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.02,0:07:38.21,ENG,133,0,0,0,,"Love, the King and Queen of Far, Far Away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.32,0:07:40.42,ENG,134,0,0,0,,"aka Mom and Dad."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.42,0:07:41.62,ENG,135,0,0,0,,Mom and Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.62,0:07:43.21,ENG,136,0,0,0,,Prince Charming?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.41,0:07:45.22,ENG,137,0,0,0,,Royal ball? Can I come?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.31,0:07:46.42,ENG,138,0,0,0,,We're not going.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.51,0:07:47.22,ENG,139,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.31,0:07:48.31,ENG,140,0,0,0,,I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.42,0:07:51.32,ENG,141,0,0,0,,don't you think they might be a bit... shocked
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.32,0:07:53.11,ENG,142,0,0,0,,to see you like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.11,0:07:55.91,ENG,143,0,0,0,,Well, they might be a bit surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.91,0:07:58.93,ENG,144,0,0,0,,But they're my parents, Shrek. They love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.02,0:08:01.52,ENG,145,0,0,0,,And don't worry. They'll love you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.72,0:08:05.51,ENG,146,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.51,0:08:07.32,ENG,147,0,0,0,,Stop it. They're not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.42,0:08:09.82,ENG,148,0,0,0,,How do you explain Sergeant Pompous
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.82,0:08:11.02,ENG,149,0,0,0,,and the Fancy Pants Club Band?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.02,0:08:14.12,ENG,150,0,0,0,,Oh, come on! You could at least give them a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.12,0:08:16.63,ENG,151,0,0,0,,To do what? Sharpen their pitchforks?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.73,0:08:19.72,ENG,152,0,0,0,,No! They just want to give you their blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.02,0:08:23.32,ENG,153,0,0,0,,Oh, great. Now I need their blessing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.32,0:08:26.12,ENG,154,0,0,0,,If you want to be a part of this family, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.12,0:08:28.13,ENG,155,0,0,0,,Who says I want to be part of this family?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.21,0:08:31.22,ENG,156,0,0,0,,You did! When you married me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.33,0:08:33.72,ENG,157,0,0,0,,Well, there's some fine print for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.72,0:08:36.82,ENG,158,0,0,0,,So that's it. You won't come?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.92,0:08:38.72,ENG,159,0,0,0,,Trust me. It's a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.82,0:08:41.62,ENG,160,0,0,0,,We are not going! And that's final!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.51,0:08:46.51,ENG,161,0,0,0,,Come on! We don't want to hit traffic!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.52,0:08:51.73,ENG,162,0,0,0,,Don't worry! We'll take care of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.22,0:09:03.62,ENG,163,0,0,0,,Hey, wait for me. Oof!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.62,0:09:08.22,ENG,164,0,0,0,,Hit it! Move 'em on! Head 'em up! Head 'em up, move 'em on! Head 'em up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.22,0:09:11.23,ENG,165,0,0,0,,Rawhide! Move 'em on! Head 'em up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.23,0:09:17.44,ENG,166,0,0,0,,Move 'em on! Move 'em on! Head 'em up! Rawhide!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.02,0:09:28.02,ENG,167,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.53,0:09:29.72,ENG,168,0,0,0,,Are we there yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.83,0:09:30.72,ENG,169,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.43,0:09:35.62,ENG,170,0,0,0,,Are we there yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.72,0:09:36.72,ENG,171,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.32,0:09:40.03,ENG,172,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.03,0:09:41.63,ENG,173,0,0,0,,OK, are we there yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.63,0:09:42.63,ENG,174,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.83,0:09:44.63,ENG,175,0,0,0,,Are we there yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.63,0:09:45.44,ENG,176,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.44,0:09:47.03,ENG,177,0,0,0,,Are we there yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.03,0:09:47.53,ENG,178,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.63,0:09:48.03,ENG,179,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.14,0:09:49.02,ENG,180,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.02,0:09:50.03,ENG,181,0,0,0,,Are we there yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.03,0:09:50.53,ENG,182,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.63,0:09:51.54,ENG,183,0,0,0,,Are we there yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.54,0:09:52.02,ENG,184,0,0,0,,We are not!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.13,0:09:54.63,ENG,185,0,0,0,,-  Are we there yet? - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.82,0:09:57.34,ENG,186,0,0,0,,Are we there yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.93,0:09:59.23,ENG,187,0,0,0,,That's not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.32,0:10:01.33,ENG,188,0,0,0,,That's really immature.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.63,0:10:04.63,ENG,189,0,0,0,,- This is why nobody likes you. - This is why nobody likes ogres.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.73,0:10:05.73,ENG,190,0,0,0,,Your loss!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.84,0:10:07.23,ENG,191,0,0,0,,I'm gonna just stop talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.33,0:10:08.62,ENG,192,0,0,0,,Finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.84,0:10:11.32,ENG,193,0,0,0,,This is taking forever, Shrek.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.32,0:10:12.83,ENG,194,0,0,0,,There's no in-flight movie or nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.93,0:10:16.42,ENG,195,0,0,0,,The Kingdom of Far, Far Away, Donkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.53,0:10:22.93,ENG,196,0,0,0,,That's where we're going. Far, far...away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.93,0:10:24.63,ENG,197,0,0,0,,All right, all right, I get it
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.22,0:10:26.62,ENG,198,0,0,0,,I'm just so darn bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.62,0:10:29.22,ENG,199,0,0,0,,Well, find a way to entertain yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.64,0:10:53.93,ENG,200,0,0,0,,For five minutes...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.53,0:10:56.84,ENG,201,0,0,0,,Could you not be yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.84,0:10:59.04,ENG,202,0,0,0,,for five minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.34,0:11:07.83,ENG,203,0,0,0,,Are we there yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.13,0:11:09.02,ENG,204,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.13,0:11:10.23,ENG,205,0,0,0,,Oh, finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.53,0:11:20.63,ENG,206,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.84,0:11:27.93,ENG,207,0,0,0,,It's going to be champagne wishes
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.93,0:11:29.94,ENG,208,0,0,0,,and caviar dreams from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.53,0:11:33.03,ENG,209,0,0,0,,Hey, good-looking! We'll be back to pick you up later!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.14,0:11:38.63,ENG,210,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.03,0:11:41.74,ENG,211,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.84,0:11:44.64,ENG,212,0,0,0,,It's too late to regret this time

.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.64,0:11:54.63,ENG,213,0,0,0,,∮ Well  I talk about it... talk about it... ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.63,0:11:58.14,ENG,214,0,0,0,,Hey, everyone, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.14,0:12:01.64,ENG,215,0,0,0,,∮ Talk about it  talk about movin... ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.13,0:12:10.33,ENG,216,0,0,0,,Hey, ladies! Nice day for a parade, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.33,0:12:13.64,ENG,217,0,0,0,,You working that hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.44,0:12:24.04,ENG,218,0,0,0,,Swimming pools! Movie stars!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.24,0:12:27.43,ENG,219,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.03,0:13:03.94,ENG,220,0,0,0,,Announcing the long-awaited return of the beautiful Princess Fiona
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.04,0:13:06.95,ENG,221,0,0,0,,and her new husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.85,0:13:10.44,ENG,222,0,0,0,,Well, this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.65,0:13:11.63,ENG,223,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.74,0:13:12.85,ENG,224,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.94,0:13:13.94,ENG,225,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.15,0:13:38.94,ENG,226,0,0,0,,Uh... why don't you guys go ahead? I'll park the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.95,0:13:44.44,ENG,227,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.64,0:13:47.44,ENG,228,0,0,0,,you still think this was a good idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.23,0:13:49.34,ENG,229,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.74,0:13:52.63,ENG,230,0,0,0,,Look. Mom and Dad look happy to see us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.63,0:13:54.95,ENG,231,0,0,0,,Who on earth are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.95,0:13:56.84,ENG,232,0,0,0,,I think that's our little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.95,0:14:00.04,ENG,233,0,0,0,,That's not little! That's a really big problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.44,0:14:03.95,ENG,234,0,0,0,,Wasn't she supposed to kiss Prince Charming and break the spell?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.95,0:14:06.94,ENG,235,0,0,0,,Well, he's no Prince Charming, but they do look...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.04,0:14:07.94,ENG,236,0,0,0,,Happy now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.95,0:14:10.74,ENG,237,0,0,0,,We came. We saw them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.94,0:14:13.65,ENG,238,0,0,0,,Now let's go before they light the torches.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.65,0:14:14.65,ENG,239,0,0,0,,They're my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.65,0:14:17.35,ENG,240,0,0,0,,Hello? They locked you in a tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.35,0:14:18.45,ENG,241,0,0,0,,That was for my own...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.55,0:14:20.05,ENG,242,0,0,0,,Good! Here's our chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.25,0:14:22.55,ENG,243,0,0,0,,Let's go back inside and pretend we're not home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.55,0:14:23.76,ENG,244,0,0,0,,Harold, we have to be...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.76,0:14:26.25,ENG,245,0,0,0,,Quick! While they're not looking we can make a run for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.45,0:14:29.04,ENG,246,0,0,0,,Shrek, stop it! Everything's gonna be...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.24,0:14:31.45,ENG,247,0,0,0,,A disaster! There is no way...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.45,0:14:32.44,ENG,248,0,0,0,,You can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.44,0:14:33.95,ENG,249,0,0,0,,I really... Really...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.95,0:14:34.24,ENG,250,0,0,0,,don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.24,0:14:34.65,ENG,251,0,0,0,,want...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.65,0:14:34.94,ENG,252,0,0,0,,to... be...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.04,0:14:36.04,ENG,253,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.14,0:14:40.55,ENG,254,0,0,0,,Mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.75,0:14:42.05,ENG,255,0,0,0,,Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.24,0:14:47.05,ENG,256,0,0,0,,I'd like you to meet my husband...Shrek.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.04,0:14:55.65,ENG,257,0,0,0,,It's easy to see where Fiona gets her good looks from.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.95,0:15:34.85,ENG,258,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.14,0:15:38.85,ENG,259,0,0,0,,Better out than in, I always say, eh, Fiona? That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.95,0:15:45.95,ENG,260,0,0,0,,I guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.95,0:15:47.25,ENG,261,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "not on the list"?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.55,0:15:48.95,ENG,262,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you don't know who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.95,0:15:52.75,ENG,263,0,0,0,,What's happening, everybody? Thanks for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.45,0:15:54.45,ENG,264,0,0,0,,I had the hardest time finding this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.45,0:15:57.16,ENG,265,0,0,0,,No! No! Bad donkey! Bad! Down!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.26,0:16:00.35,ENG,266,0,0,0,,No, Dad! It's all right. It's all right. He's with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.35,0:16:02.05,ENG,267,0,0,0,,He helped rescue me from the dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.05,0:16:03.66,ENG,268,0,0,0,,That's me: the noble steed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.86,0:16:05.96,ENG,269,0,0,0,,Waiter! How 'bout a bowl for the steed?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.05,0:16:07.46,ENG,270,0,0,0,,Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.16,0:16:10.85,ENG,271,0,0,0,,Um, Shrek?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.85,0:16:13.36,ENG,272,0,0,0,,Yeah?Oh, sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.45,0:16:16.15,ENG,273,0,0,0,,Great soup, Mrs Q.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.75,0:16:18.35,ENG,274,0,0,0,,No, no. Darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.55,0:16:26.64,ENG,275,0,0,0,,So, Fiona, tell us about where you live.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.25,0:16:30.46,ENG,276,0,0,0,,Well...Shrek owns his own land.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.25,0:16:32.86,ENG,277,0,0,0,,Don't you, honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.86,0:16:34.25,ENG,278,0,0,0,,Oh, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.25,0:16:37.15,ENG,279,0,0,0,,It's in an enchanted forest
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.15,0:16:42.95,ENG,280,0,0,0,,abundant in squirrels and cute little duckies and...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.05,0:16:44.06,ENG,281,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.26,0:16:45.35,ENG,282,0,0,0,,I know you ain't talking about the swamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.37,0:16:45.86,ENG,283,0,0,0,,Donkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.97,0:16:49.16,ENG,284,0,0,0,,An ogre from a swamp. Oh! How original.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.97,0:16:53.26,ENG,285,0,0,0,,I suppose that would be a fine place to raise the children.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.25,0:17:06.06,ENG,286,0,0,0,,It's a bit early to be thinking about that, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.06,0:17:08.95,ENG,287,0,0,0,,-  lndeed. I just started eating. - Harold!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.95,0:17:10.56,ENG,288,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.65,0:17:11.36,ENG,289,0,0,0,,Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.45,0:17:12.55,ENG,290,0,0,0,,It's great, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.66,0:17:13.86,ENG,291,0,0,0,,For his type, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.96,0:17:15.35,ENG,292,0,0,0,,My type?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.35,0:17:17.15,ENG,293,0,0,0,,I got to go to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.35,0:17:19.25,ENG,294,0,0,0,,Dinner is served!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.25,0:17:20.67,ENG,295,0,0,0,,Never mind. I can hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.26,0:17:27.85,ENG,296,0,0,0,,Bon appetit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.96,0:17:29.96,ENG,297,0,0,0,,Oh, Mexican food! My favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.96,0:17:33.95,ENG,298,0,0,0,,Let's not sit here with our tummies rumbling. Everybody dig in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.95,0:17:35.16,ENG,299,0,0,0,,Don't mind if I do, Lillian.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.16,0:17:39.17,ENG,300,0,0,0,,I suppose any grandchildren I could expect from you would be...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.17,0:17:40.96,ENG,301,0,0,0,,Ogres, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.36,0:17:43.16,ENG,302,0,0,0,,Not that there's anything wrong with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.26,0:17:44.27,ENG,303,0,0,0,,Right, Harold?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.27,0:17:46.46,ENG,304,0,0,0,,Oh, no! No! Of course, not!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.56,0:17:49.56,ENG,305,0,0,0,,That is, assuming you don't eat your own young!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.56,0:17:50.37,ENG,306,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.37,0:17:55.06,ENG,307,0,0,0,,No, we usually prefer the ones who've been locked away in a tower!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.56,0:17:56.16,ENG,308,0,0,0,,Shrek, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.16,0:17:57.96,ENG,309,0,0,0,,I only did that because I love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.96,0:18:01.16,ENG,310,0,0,0,,Aye, day care or dragon-guarded castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.16,0:18:03.26,ENG,311,0,0,0,,You wouldn't understand. You're not her father!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.55,0:18:11.96,ENG,312,0,0,0,,It's so nice to have the family together for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.77,0:18:17.87,ENG,313,0,0,0,,-  Harold! - Shrek!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.96,0:18:18.97,ENG,314,0,0,0,,-  Fiona! - Fiona!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.97,0:18:20.37,ENG,315,0,0,0,,-  Mom! - Harold...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.37,0:18:21.56,ENG,316,0,0,0,,Donkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.57,0:19:27.76,ENG,317,0,0,0,,∮ Yourfallen tears have called to me ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.76,0:19:32.17,ENG,318,0,0,0,,∮ So, here comes my sweet remedy ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.97,0:19:37.87,ENG,319,0,0,0,,∮ I know what every princess needs ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.96,0:19:43.36,ENG,320,0,0,0,,∮ For her to live life happily... ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.17,0:19:45.97,ENG,321,0,0,0,,Oh, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.07,0:19:47.96,ENG,322,0,0,0,,Oh, look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.96,0:19:49.96,ENG,323,0,0,0,,You're all
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.07,0:19:51.16,ENG,324,0,0,0,,grown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.17,0:19:53.67,ENG,325,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.67,0:19:57.46,ENG,326,0,0,0,,Oh, sweet pea! I'm your fairy godmother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.46,0:19:58.97,ENG,327,0,0,0,,I have a fairy godmother?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.27,0:20:04.26,ENG,328,0,0,0,,Shush, shush.Now, don't worry. I'm here to make it all better.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.47,0:20:07.96,ENG,329,0,0,0,,With just a...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.47,0:20:11.48,ENG,330,0,0,0,,∮ Wave of my magic wand Your troubles will soon be gone ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.37,0:20:14.97,ENG,331,0,0,0,,∮ With a flick of the wrist and just a flash You'll land a prince with a ton of cash ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.97,0:20:16.98,ENG,332,0,0,0,,∮ A high-priced dress made by mice no less ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.07,0:20:18.88,ENG,333,0,0,0,,∮ Some crystal glass pumps And no more stress ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.08,0:20:21.37,ENG,334,0,0,0,,∮ Your worries will vanish, your soul will cleanse ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.47,0:20:23.48,ENG,335,0,0,0,,∮ Confide in your very own furniture friends ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.68,0:20:25.67,ENG,336,0,0,0,,∮ We 'll help you set a new fashion trend ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.67,0:20:28.27,ENG,337,0,0,0,,∮ I'll make you fancy ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.37,0:20:30.77,ENG,338,0,0,0,,∮ I'll make you great ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.97,0:20:32.56,ENG,339,0,0,0,,∮ The kind of girl a prince would date ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.67,0:20:35.27,ENG,340,0,0,0,,∮ They'll write your name on the bathroom wall... ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.37,0:20:36.97,ENG,341,0,0,0,,∮ For a happy ever after, give Fiona a call ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.97,0:20:40.97,ENG,342,0,0,0,,∮ A sporty carriage to ride in style, Sexy man boy chauffeur, Kyle ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.06,0:20:44.68,ENG,343,0,0,0,,∮ Banish your blemishes, tooth decay, Cellulite thighs will fade away ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.77,0:20:47.48,ENG,344,0,0,0,,∮ And oh, what the hey! Have a bichon frise! ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.17,0:20:51.37,ENG,345,0,0,0,,∮ Nip and tuck, here and there to land that prince with the perfect hair ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.48,0:20:54.87,ENG,346,0,0,0,,∮ Lipstick liners, shadows blush To get that prince with the sexy tush ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.97,0:20:57.86,ENG,347,0,0,0,,∮ Lucky day, hunk buffet You and your prince take a roll in the hay ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.97,0:21:01.28,ENG,348,0,0,0,,∮ You can spoon on the moon With the prince to the tune ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.38,0:21:03.97,ENG,349,0,0,0,,∮ Don't be drab, you'll be fab Your prince will have rock-hard abs ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.08,0:21:06.67,ENG,350,0,0,0,,∮ Cheese souffle, Valentine's Day Have some chicken fricassee ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.78,0:21:09.38,ENG,351,0,0,0,,∮ Nip and tuck, here and there To land that prince with the perfect hair ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.38,0:21:11.48,ENG,352,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.88,0:21:13.38,ENG,353,0,0,0,,Look...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.78,0:21:16.48,ENG,354,0,0,0,,Thank you very much, Fairy Godmother,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.48,0:21:19.17,ENG,355,0,0,0,,but I really don't need all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.37,0:21:23.97,ENG,356,0,0,0,,Fine. Be that way. We didn't like you, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.27,0:21:26.47,ENG,357,0,0,0,,Fiona?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.58,0:21:27.58,ENG,358,0,0,0,,Fiona?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.57,0:21:34.58,ENG,359,0,0,0,,Oh! You got a puppy? All I got in my room was shampoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.38,0:21:37.68,ENG,360,0,0,0,,Fairy Godmother,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.98,0:21:39.38,ENG,361,0,0,0,,furniture...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.57,0:21:41.99,ENG,362,0,0,0,,I'd like you to meet my husband, Shrek.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.08,0:21:42.97,ENG,363,0,0,0,,Your husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.07,0:21:43.97,ENG,364,0,0,0,,What? What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.28,0:21:45.98,ENG,365,0,0,0,,When did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.98,0:21:47.67,ENG,366,0,0,0,,Shrek is the one who rescued me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.67,0:21:48.68,ENG,367,0,0,0,,But that can't be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.78,0:21:51.68,ENG,368,0,0,0,,Oh, great, more relatives!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.78,0:21:52.98,ENG,369,0,0,0,,She's just trying to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.09,0:21:54.88,ENG,370,0,0,0,,Good! She can help us pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.98,0:21:56.49,ENG,371,0,0,0,,Get your coat, dear. We're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.58,0:21:58.19,ENG,372,0,0,0,,What?  I don't want to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.28,0:21:59.58,ENG,373,0,0,0,,When did you decide this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.58,0:22:01.18,ENG,374,0,0,0,,Shortly after arriving.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.38,0:22:02.28,ENG,375,0,0,0,,Look, I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.58,0:22:05.78,ENG,376,0,0,0,,No, that's all right. I need to go, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.08,0:22:07.38,ENG,377,0,0,0,,But remember, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.48,0:22:09.37,ENG,378,0,0,0,,If you should ever need me...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.37,0:22:12.58,ENG,379,0,0,0,,happiness... is just a teardrop away.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.69,0:22:14.47,ENG,380,0,0,0,,Thanks, but we've got all the happiness we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.47,0:22:16.48,ENG,381,0,0,0,,Happy, happy, happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.58,0:22:18.07,ENG,382,0,0,0,,So I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.48,0:22:20.77,ENG,383,0,0,0,,Let's go, Kyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.07,0:22:25.68,ENG,384,0,0,0,,-  Very nice, Shrek. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.68,0:22:28.18,ENG,385,0,0,0,,I told you coming here was a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.18,0:22:30.88,ENG,386,0,0,0,,You could've at least tried to get along with my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.88,0:22:33.48,ENG,387,0,0,0,,I don't think I was going to get Daddy's blessing,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.48,0:22:35.28,ENG,388,0,0,0,,even if I did want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.28,0:22:39.27,ENG,389,0,0,0,,Do you think it might be nice if somebody asked me what I wanted?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.48,0:22:42.08,ENG,390,0,0,0,,Sure. Do you want me to pack for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.08,0:22:44.09,ENG,391,0,0,0,,You're unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.19,0:22:45.69,ENG,392,0,0,0,,You're behaving like a...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.08,0:22:48.58,ENG,393,0,0,0,,Go on! Say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.78,0:22:49.98,ENG,394,0,0,0,,Like an ogre!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.09,0:22:51.48,ENG,395,0,0,0,,Here's a news flash for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.48,0:22:55.48,ENG,396,0,0,0,,Whether your parents like it or not... I am an ogre!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.48,0:23:05.49,ENG,397,0,0,0,,And guess what, Princess? That's not about to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.19,0:23:14.97,ENG,398,0,0,0,,I've made changes for you, Shrek. Think about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.08,0:23:23.18,ENG,399,0,0,0,,That's real smooth, Shrek. "I'm an ogre!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.09,0:23:48.48,ENG,400,0,0,0,,I knew this would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.69,0:23:50.49,ENG,401,0,0,0,,You should. You started it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.59,0:23:52.48,ENG,402,0,0,0,,I can hardly believe that, Lillian.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.59,0:23:54.69,ENG,403,0,0,0,,He's the ogre. Not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.79,0:23:57.98,ENG,404,0,0,0,,I think, Harold, you're taking this a little too personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.19,0:24:00.18,ENG,405,0,0,0,,This is Fiona's choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.39,0:24:03.57,ENG,406,0,0,0,,But she was supposed to choose the prince we picked for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.57,0:24:07.99,ENG,407,0,0,0,,I mean, you expect me to give my blessings to this... thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.09,0:24:09.09,ENG,408,0,0,0,,Fiona does.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.09,0:24:11.49,ENG,409,0,0,0,,And she'll never forgive you if you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.49,0:24:15.38,ENG,410,0,0,0,,I don't want to lose our daughter again, Harold.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.49,0:24:19.58,ENG,411,0,0,0,,Oh, you act as if love is totally predictable.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.68,0:24:21.99,ENG,412,0,0,0,,Don't you remember when we were young?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.18,0:24:24.89,ENG,413,0,0,0,,We used to walk down by the lily pond and...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.49,0:24:26.70,ENG,414,0,0,0,,they were in bloom...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.79,0:24:27.99,ENG,415,0,0,0,,Our first kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.90,0:24:30.10,ENG,416,0,0,0,,It's not the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.19,0:24:32.60,ENG,417,0,0,0,,I don't think you realize that our daughter
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.69,0:24:34.39,ENG,418,0,0,0,,has married a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.50,0:24:36.49,ENG,419,0,0,0,,Oh, stop being such a drama king.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.59,0:24:39.90,ENG,420,0,0,0,,Fine! Pretend there's nothing wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.98,0:24:43.49,ENG,421,0,0,0,,Isn't it all wonderful! I'd like to know how it could get any worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.09,0:24:44.89,ENG,422,0,0,0,,Hello, Harold.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.00,0:24:45.99,ENG,423,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.08,0:24:47.49,ENG,424,0,0,0,,Nothing, dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.59,0:24:50.69,ENG,425,0,0,0,,Just the old crusade wound playing up a bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.38,0:24:54.08,ENG,426,0,0,0,,I'll just stretch it out here for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.29,0:24:55.09,ENG,427,0,0,0,,You better get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.28,0:24:56.89,ENG,428,0,0,0,,We need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.19,0:24:59.50,ENG,429,0,0,0,,Actually, Fairy Godmother, off to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.69,0:25:03.39,ENG,430,0,0,0,,Already taken my pills, and they tend to make me a bit drowsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.50,0:25:06.48,ENG,431,0,0,0,,So, how about... we make this a quick visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.48,0:25:07.49,ENG,432,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.69,0:25:09.49,ENG,433,0,0,0,,Oh, hello. Ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.89,0:25:14.19,ENG,434,0,0,0,,So, what's new?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.28,0:25:17.60,ENG,435,0,0,0,,You remember my son, Prince Charming?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.69,0:25:21.69,ENG,436,0,0,0,,Is that you? My gosh! It's been years.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.80,0:25:23.90,ENG,437,0,0,0,,When did you get back?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.00,0:25:26.60,ENG,438,0,0,0,,Oh, about five minutes ago, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.99,0:25:30.69,ENG,439,0,0,0,,After I endured blistering winds, scorching desert...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.80,0:25:32.89,ENG,440,0,0,0,,I climbed to the highest room in the tallest tower...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.09,0:25:35.49,ENG,441,0,0,0,,Mommy can handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.29,0:25:40.10,ENG,442,0,0,0,,He endures blistering winds and scorching desert!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.10,0:25:44.09,ENG,443,0,0,0,,He climbs to the highest bloody room of the tallest bloody tower...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.09,0:25:45.48,ENG,444,0,0,0,,- But... - And what does he find?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.48,0:25:47.69,ENG,445,0,0,0,,Some gender-confused wolf
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.69,0:25:49.49,ENG,446,0,0,0,,telling him that his princess
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.49,0:25:51.00,ENG,447,0,0,0,,is already married.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.09,0:25:54.20,ENG,448,0,0,0,,It wasn't my fault. He didn't get there in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.20,0:25:55.99,ENG,449,0,0,0,,Stop the car!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.80,0:25:59.09,ENG,450,0,0,0,,Harold.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.30,0:26:04.79,ENG,451,0,0,0,,You force me to do something I really don't want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.49,0:26:06.19,ENG,452,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.00,0:26:09.70,ENG,453,0,0,0,,Hi. Welcome to Friar's Fat Boy! May I take your order?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.90,0:26:13.30,ENG,454,0,0,0,,My diet is ruined! I hope you're happy. Er... okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.40,0:26:17.10,ENG,455,0,0,0,,Two Renaissance Wraps, no mayo... chili rings...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.19,0:26:18.40,ENG,456,0,0,0,,I'll have the Medieval Meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.50,0:26:21.59,ENG,457,0,0,0,,One Medieval Meal and, Harold...Curly fries?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.70,0:26:22.60,ENG,458,0,0,0,,No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.70,0:26:23.71,ENG,459,0,0,0,,Sourdough soft taco, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.71,0:26:24.69,ENG,460,0,0,0,,No, really, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.69,0:26:26.69,ENG,461,0,0,0,,Your order, Fairy Godmother.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.90,0:26:29.10,ENG,462,0,0,0,,This comes with the Medieval Meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.30,0:26:30.59,ENG,463,0,0,0,,There you are, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.70,0:26:35.60,ENG,464,0,0,0,,We made a deal, Harold,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.60,0:26:38.20,ENG,465,0,0,0,,and I assume you don't want me to go back on my part.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.29,0:26:39.80,ENG,466,0,0,0,,Indeed not.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.89,0:26:43.80,ENG,467,0,0,0,,So, Fiona and Charming will be together.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.80,0:26:44.70,ENG,468,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.80,0:26:47.50,ENG,469,0,0,0,,Believe me, Harold. It's what's best.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.60,0:26:50.29,ENG,470,0,0,0,,Not only for your daughter...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.50,0:26:53.10,ENG,471,0,0,0,,but for your Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.19,0:27:00.21,ENG,472,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.51,0:27:03.21,ENG,473,0,0,0,,Use your imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.70,0:27:28.49,ENG,474,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.20,0:27:44.00,ENG,475,0,0,0,,Come on in, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.00,0:27:52.91,ENG,476,0,0,0,,∮ I like my town ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.51,0:27:58.40,ENG,477,0,0,0,,∮ With a little drop of poison ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.30,0:28:01.91,ENG,478,0,0,0,,∮ Nobody knows... ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.01,0:28:04.81,ENG,479,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.01,0:28:07.00,ENG,480,0,0,0,,Do I know you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.51,0:28:10.30,ENG,481,0,0,0,,No, you must be mistaking me for someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.40,0:28:14.90,ENG,482,0,0,0,,Uh... excuse me. I'm looking for the Ugly Stepsister.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.70,0:28:19.20,ENG,483,0,0,0,,Ah! There you are. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.60,0:28:24.61,ENG,484,0,0,0,,You see, I need to have someone taken care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.01,0:28:25.81,ENG,485,0,0,0,,Who's the guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.91,0:28:28.61,ENG,486,0,0,0,,Well, he's not a guy, per se.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.21,0:28:30.60,ENG,487,0,0,0,,Um... He's an ogre.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.30,0:28:35.51,ENG,488,0,0,0,,Hey, buddy, let me clue you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.51,0:28:38.40,ENG,489,0,0,0,,There's only one fellow who can handle a job like that, and, frankly...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.50,0:28:41.62,ENG,490,0,0,0,,he don't like to be disturbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.62,0:28:42.91,ENG,491,0,0,0,,Where could I find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.31,0:28:48.02,ENG,492,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.21,0:28:51.81,ENG,493,0,0,0,,Who dares enter my room?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.11,0:28:54.11,ENG,494,0,0,0,,Sorry! I hope I'm not interrupting,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.21,0:28:58.00,ENG,495,0,0,0,,but I'm told you're the one to talk to about an ogre problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.11,0:28:59.91,ENG,496,0,0,0,,You are told correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.00,0:29:03.31,ENG,497,0,0,0,,But for this, I charge a great deal of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.31,0:29:06.40,ENG,498,0,0,0,,Would... this be enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.90,0:29:17.51,ENG,499,0,0,0,,You have engaged my valuable services, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.61,0:29:21.81,ENG,500,0,0,0,,Just tell me where I can find this ogre.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.31,0:29:27.11,ENG,501,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.21,0:29:45.91,ENG,502,0,0,0,,∮ Everyone says I'm getting down too low ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.72,0:29:52.82,ENG,503,0,0,0,,∮ Everyone says you've just gotta let it go ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.82,0:29:56.60,ENG,504,0,0,0,,∮ You just gotta let it go ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.91,0:30:08.51,ENG,505,0,0,0,,∮ I need some sleep ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.51,0:30:11.91,ENG,506,0,0,0,,∮ Time to put the old horse down ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.31,0:30:15.81,ENG,507,0,0,0,,∮ I'm in too deep ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.92,0:30:19.21,ENG,508,0,0,0,,∮ And the wheels keep spinning round ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.32,0:30:26.92,ENG,509,0,0,0,,∮ Everyone says you've just gotta let it go ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.02,0:30:34.31,ENG,510,0,0,0,,Dear Knight, I pray that you take this favor as a token of my gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.01,0:30:57.91,ENG,511,0,0,0,,Dear Diary...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.52,0:31:01.21,ENG,512,0,0,0,,Sleeping Beauty is having a slumber party tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.32,0:31:02.72,ENG,513,0,0,0,,but Dad says I can't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.91,0:31:04.92,ENG,514,0,0,0,,He never lets me out after sunset.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.71,0:31:08.12,ENG,515,0,0,0,,Dad says I'm going away for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.21,0:31:10.82,ENG,516,0,0,0,,Must be like some finishing school.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.81,0:31:13.42,ENG,517,0,0,0,,Mom says that when I'm old enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.01,0:31:16.62,ENG,518,0,0,0,,my Prince Charming will rescue me from my tower
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.62,0:31:18.52,ENG,519,0,0,0,,and bring me back to my family,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.52,0:31:21.92,ENG,520,0,0,0,,and we'll all live happily ever after.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.82,0:31:26.22,ENG,521,0,0,0,,Mrs. Fiona Charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.82,0:31:29.22,ENG,522,0,0,0,,Mrs. Fiona Charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.92,0:31:31.22,ENG,523,0,0,0,,Mrs. Fiona Charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.22,0:31:36.52,ENG,524,0,0,0,,Mrs. Fiona Charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.91,0:31:46.31,ENG,525,0,0,0,,Sorry. I hope I'm not interrupting anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.51,0:31:48.92,ENG,526,0,0,0,,No, no. I was just reading a, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.22,0:31:51.42,ENG,527,0,0,0,,A scary book.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.31,0:31:56.62,ENG,528,0,0,0,,I was hoping you'd let me apologize for my despicable behavior earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.72,0:31:58.02,ENG,529,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.12,0:31:59.52,ENG,530,0,0,0,,I don't know what came over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.62,0:32:02.51,ENG,531,0,0,0,,Do you suppose we could pretend it never happened and start over...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.51,0:32:04.52,ENG,532,0,0,0,,Look, Your Majesty, I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.72,0:32:05.93,ENG,533,0,0,0,,Please. Call me Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.13,0:32:07.13,ENG,534,0,0,0,,Dad
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.83,0:32:10.42,ENG,535,0,0,0,,We both acted like ogres.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.73,0:32:13.62,ENG,536,0,0,0,,Maybe we just need some time to get to know each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.93,0:32:15.03,ENG,537,0,0,0,,Excellent idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.03,0:32:18.53,ENG,538,0,0,0,,I was actually hoping you might join me for a morning hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.53,0:32:21.82,ENG,539,0,0,0,,A little father-son time?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.32,0:32:24.82,ENG,540,0,0,0,,I know it would mean the world to Fiona.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.72,0:32:37.33,ENG,541,0,0,0,,Shall we say, 7:30 by the old oak?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.43,0:32:45.42,ENG,542,0,0,0,,Face it, Donkey! We're lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.42,0:32:48.42,ENG,543,0,0,0,,We can't be lost. We followed the King's instructions exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.42,0:32:50.73,ENG,544,0,0,0,,"Head to the darkest part of the woods..."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.73,0:32:51.32,ENG,545,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.32,0:32:53.52,ENG,546,0,0,0,,"Past the sinister trees with scary-looking branches."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.92,0:32:54.52,ENG,547,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.52,0:32:56.43,ENG,548,0,0,0,,The bush shaped like Shirley Bassey!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.53,0:32:58.93,ENG,549,0,0,0,,We passed that three times already!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.13,0:33:01.52,ENG,550,0,0,0,,You were the one who said not to stop for directions.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.52,0:33:02.13,ENG,551,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.13,0:33:03.13,ENG,552,0,0,0,,Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.13,0:33:06.33,ENG,553,0,0,0,,My one chance to fix things up with Fiona's dad
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.33,0:33:08.53,ENG,554,0,0,0,,and I end up lost in the woods with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.63,0:33:11.23,ENG,555,0,0,0,,Don't get huffy! I'm only trying to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.33,0:33:13.12,ENG,556,0,0,0,,I know! I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.72,0:33:16.83,ENG,557,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.92,0:33:18.73,ENG,558,0,0,0,,Hey, don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.82,0:33:21.82,ENG,559,0,0,0,,I just really need to make things work with this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.02,0:33:24.52,ENG,560,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure. Now let's go bond with Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.03,0:33:34.13,ENG,561,0,0,0,,Well, well, well, Donkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.13,0:33:38.23,ENG,562,0,0,0,,I know it was kind of a tender moment back there, but the purring?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.23,0:33:40.02,ENG,563,0,0,0,,What? I ain't purring.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.13,0:33:42.42,ENG,564,0,0,0,,Sure. What's next? A hug?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.53,0:33:45.62,ENG,565,0,0,0,,Hey, Shrek. Donkeys don't purr. What do you think I am, some kind of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.92,0:33:49.13,ENG,566,0,0,0,,Ha-ha! Fear me, if you dare!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.13,0:33:51.14,ENG,567,0,0,0,,Look! A little cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.23,0:33:52.64,ENG,568,0,0,0,,Look out, Shrek! He got a piece!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.73,0:33:57.04,ENG,569,0,0,0,,It's a cat, Donkey. Come here, little kitty, kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.13,0:34:01.53,ENG,570,0,0,0,,Come on, little kitty. Come here. Oh! Come here, little kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.42,0:34:05.73,ENG,571,0,0,0,,Hold on, Shrek! I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.03,0:34:06.73,ENG,572,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.23,0:34:08.02,ENG,573,0,0,0,,Get it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.13,0:34:09.72,ENG,574,0,0,0,,Get it off!Oh, God. Oh...No
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.13,0:34:15.93,ENG,575,0,0,0,,Look out, Shrek!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.52,0:34:17.82,ENG,576,0,0,0,,Get it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.92,0:34:19.13,ENG,577,0,0,0,,Hold still!   Shrek! Hold still!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.04,0:34:21.84,ENG,578,0,0,0,,Did I miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.13,0:34:23.23,ENG,579,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.54,0:34:24.62,ENG,580,0,0,0,,You got them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.43,0:34:29.72,ENG,581,0,0,0,,Now, ye ogre, pray for mercy from...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.23,0:34:32.14,ENG,582,0,0,0,,Puss...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.92,0:34:36.13,ENG,583,0,0,0,,in Boots!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.52,0:34:38.53,ENG,584,0,0,0,,I'll kill that cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.63,0:34:59.53,ENG,585,0,0,0,,Hairball.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.03,0:35:01.53,ENG,586,0,0,0,,Oh! That is nasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.43,0:35:04.13,ENG,587,0,0,0,,What should we do with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.13,0:35:06.32,ENG,588,0,0,0,,Take the sword and neuter him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.43,0:35:07.94,ENG,589,0,0,0,,Give him the Bob Barker treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.94,0:35:09.92,ENG,590,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Por favor! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.03,0:35:12.63,ENG,591,0,0,0,,I implore you! It was nothing personal, Senor.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.63,0:35:15.13,ENG,592,0,0,0,,I was doing it only for my family.My mother, she is sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.24,0:35:18.33,ENG,593,0,0,0,,And my father lives off the garbage!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.44,0:35:20.93,ENG,594,0,0,0,,The King offered me much in gold and I have a litter of brothers...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.93,0:35:25.33,ENG,595,0,0,0,,Fiona's father paid you to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.43,0:35:27.23,ENG,596,0,0,0,,The rich King? Si.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.85,0:35:34.14,ENG,597,0,0,0,,Well, so much for Dad's royal blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.25,0:35:36.23,ENG,598,0,0,0,,Don't feel bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.23,0:35:38.04,ENG,599,0,0,0,,Almost everybody that meets you wants to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.04,0:35:39.44,ENG,600,0,0,0,,Gee, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.44,0:35:44.34,ENG,601,0,0,0,,Maybe Fiona would've been better off
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.34,0:35:46.44,ENG,602,0,0,0,,if I were some sort of Prince Charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.44,0:35:48.43,ENG,603,0,0,0,,That's what the King said.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.04,0:35:53.33,ENG,604,0,0,0,,Oh, uh... sorry. I thought that question was directed at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.64,0:35:57.23,ENG,605,0,0,0,,Shrek, Fiona knows you'd do anything for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.53,0:36:00.23,ENG,606,0,0,0,,Well, it's not like I wouldn't change if I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.13,0:36:04.84,ENG,607,0,0,0,,I just... I just wish I could make her happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.73,0:36:08.24,ENG,608,0,0,0,,Hold the phone...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.34,0:36:11.64,ENG,609,0,0,0,,"Happiness".
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.33,0:36:14.53,ENG,610,0,0,0,,"A tear drop away".
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.64,0:36:18.93,ENG,611,0,0,0,,Donkey! Think of the saddest thing that's ever happened to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.24,0:36:21.34,ENG,612,0,0,0,,Aw, man, where do I begin?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.34,0:36:24.84,ENG,613,0,0,0,,First there was the time that old farmer tried to sell me for some magic beans.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.84,0:36:25.84,ENG,614,0,0,0,,Then this fool had a party
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.84,0:36:29.55,ENG,615,0,0,0,,and he have the guests trying to pin the tail on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.55,0:36:30.54,ENG,616,0,0,0,,Then they got drunk
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.54,0:36:32.75,ENG,617,0,0,0,,and start beating me with a stick,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.84,0:36:33.75,ENG,618,0,0,0,,going "Pinata!!"
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.75,0:36:35.24,ENG,619,0,0,0,,What is a pinata, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.45,0:36:37.94,ENG,620,0,0,0,,No, Donkey! I need you to cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.94,0:36:39.74,ENG,621,0,0,0,,Don't go projecting on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.85,0:36:41.83,ENG,622,0,0,0,,I know you're feeling bad, but you got to...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.53,0:36:47.04,ENG,623,0,0,0,,You little, hairy, litter-licking sack of...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.15,0:36:56.74,ENG,624,0,0,0,,What? Is it on? Is it on?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.74,0:36:59.44,ENG,625,0,0,0,,This is Fairy Godmother.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.54,0:37:02.03,ENG,626,0,0,0,,I'm either away from my desk or with a client.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.03,0:37:04.04,ENG,627,0,0,0,,But if you come by the office,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.14,0:37:06.54,ENG,628,0,0,0,,we'll be glad to make you an appointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.74,0:37:08.34,ENG,629,0,0,0,,Have a "happy ever after. "
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.54,0:37:14.65,ENG,630,0,0,0,,Are you up for a little quest, Donkey?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.75,0:37:16.05,ENG,631,0,0,0,,That's more like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.05,0:37:18.55,ENG,632,0,0,0,,Shrek and Donkey, on another whirlwind adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.55,0:37:21.35,ENG,633,0,0,0,,∮ Ain't no stoppin' us now! Whoo! We're on the move! ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.95,0:37:23.04,ENG,634,0,0,0,,Stop, Ogre!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.04,0:37:25.04,ENG,635,0,0,0,,I have misjudged you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.04,0:37:26.84,ENG,636,0,0,0,,Join the club. We've got jackets.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.84,0:37:28.05,ENG,637,0,0,0,,On my honor,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.05,0:37:30.84,ENG,638,0,0,0,,I am obliged to accompany you until I have saved your life
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.84,0:37:32.54,ENG,639,0,0,0,,as you have spared me mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.73,0:37:36.24,ENG,640,0,0,0,,The position of annoying talking animal has already been taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.24,0:37:37.55,ENG,641,0,0,0,,Let's go, Shrek.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.14,0:37:39.14,ENG,642,0,0,0,,Shrek?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.14,0:37:48.75,ENG,643,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.75,0:37:51.25,ENG,644,0,0,0,,-  Shrek! - Aw, come on, Donkey. Look at him...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.25,0:37:53.05,ENG,645,0,0,0,,in his wee little boots.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.24,0:37:56.14,ENG,646,0,0,0,,You know, how many cats can wear boots? Honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.35,0:37:58.15,ENG,647,0,0,0,,Let's keep him!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.15,0:37:59.14,ENG,648,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.96,0:38:04.66,ENG,649,0,0,0,,Listen. He's purring!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.66,0:38:05.94,ENG,650,0,0,0,,Oh, so now it's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.94,0:38:07.95,ENG,651,0,0,0,,Come on, Donkey. Lighten up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.95,0:38:08.55,ENG,652,0,0,0,,Lighten up?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.55,0:38:10.55,ENG,653,0,0,0,,Lighten up? I should lighten up?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.55,0:38:11.55,ENG,654,0,0,0,,Look who's telling who to lighten up!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.85,0:38:15.85,ENG,655,0,0,0,,Shrek!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.05,0:38:21.95,ENG,656,0,0,0,,Shrek?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.04,0:38:35.04,ENG,657,0,0,0,,They're both festive, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.04,0:38:36.85,ENG,658,0,0,0,,What do you think, Harold?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.06,0:38:39.35,ENG,659,0,0,0,,Um... Yes, yes. Fine. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.55,0:38:45.55,ENG,660,0,0,0,,Try to at least pretend you're interested in your daughter's wedding ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.55,0:38:47.95,ENG,661,0,0,0,,Honestly, Lillian, I don't think it matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.05,0:38:50.34,ENG,662,0,0,0,,How do we know there will even be a ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.45,0:38:52.15,ENG,663,0,0,0,,Mom. Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.15,0:38:53.55,ENG,664,0,0,0,,Oh, hello, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.55,0:38:56.25,ENG,665,0,0,0,,What's that, Cedric? Right! Coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.25,0:38:58.65,ENG,666,0,0,0,,Mom, have you seen Shrek?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.65,0:39:01.35,ENG,667,0,0,0,,I haven't. You should ask your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.66,0:39:04.36,ENG,668,0,0,0,,Be sure and use small words, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.55,0:39:05.75,ENG,669,0,0,0,,He's a little slow this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.15,0:39:07.85,ENG,670,0,0,0,,Can I help you, Your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.95,0:39:12.55,ENG,671,0,0,0,,Mmm! Exquisite. What do you call this dish?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.55,0:39:15.84,ENG,672,0,0,0,,That would be the dog's breakfast, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.84,0:39:19.55,ENG,673,0,0,0,,Ah, yes. Very good, then. Carry on, Cedric.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.65,0:39:22.25,ENG,674,0,0,0,,Dad? Dad, have you seen Shrek?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.25,0:39:23.24,ENG,675,0,0,0,,No, I haven't, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.64,0:39:26.05,ENG,676,0,0,0,,I'm sure he just went off to look for a nice...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.05,0:39:27.65,ENG,677,0,0,0,,mud hole to cool down in.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.65,0:39:30.06,ENG,678,0,0,0,,You know, after your little spat last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.06,0:39:31.85,ENG,679,0,0,0,,Oh. You heard that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.85,0:39:34.15,ENG,680,0,0,0,,The whole kingdom heard you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.15,0:39:35.56,ENG,681,0,0,0,,I mean, after all, it is in his nature to be...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.56,0:39:38.55,ENG,682,0,0,0,,well, a bit of a brute.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.74,0:39:39.55,ENG,683,0,0,0,,Him?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.55,0:39:42.55,ENG,684,0,0,0,,You know, you didn't exactly roll out the Welcome Wagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.55,0:39:45.96,ENG,685,0,0,0,,Well, what did you expect? Look at what he's done to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.06,0:39:49.66,ENG,686,0,0,0,,Shrek loves me for who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.06,0:39:52.36,ENG,687,0,0,0,,I would think you'd be happy for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.56,0:39:56.16,ENG,688,0,0,0,,Darling, I'm just thinking about what's best for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.26,0:39:59.05,ENG,689,0,0,0,,Maybe you should do the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.25,0:40:14.34,ENG,690,0,0,0,,No, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.96,0:40:29.95,ENG,691,0,0,0,,Oh, no. That's the old Keebler's place. Let's back away slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.36,0:40:31.95,ENG,692,0,0,0,,That's the Fairy Godmother's cottage.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.95,0:40:35.36,ENG,693,0,0,0,,She's the largest producer of hexes and potions in the whole kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.56,0:40:37.86,ENG,694,0,0,0,,Then why don't we pop in there for a spell?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.06,0:40:39.36,ENG,695,0,0,0,,Ha-ha! Spell!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.56,0:40:45.56,ENG,696,0,0,0,,He makes me laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.35,0:40:54.05,ENG,697,0,0,0,,Hi. I'm here to see the...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.05,0:40:55.15,ENG,698,0,0,0,,The Fairy Godmother.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.26,0:40:57.36,ENG,699,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. She is not in.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.45,0:40:59.06,ENG,700,0,0,0,,Jerome! Coffee and a Monte Cristo.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.06,0:41:00.06,ENG,701,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.15,0:41:04.54,ENG,702,0,0,0,,Yes, Fairy Godmother. Right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.54,0:41:07.35,ENG,703,0,0,0,,Look, she's not seeing any clients today, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.35,0:41:09.46,ENG,704,0,0,0,,That's OK, buddy. We're from the union.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.57,0:41:10.87,ENG,705,0,0,0,,The union?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.87,0:41:12.07,ENG,706,0,0,0,,We represent the workers
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.07,0:41:15.36,ENG,707,0,0,0,,in all magical industries, both evil and benign.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.47,0:41:16.86,ENG,708,0,0,0,,Oh! Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.97,0:41:20.15,ENG,709,0,0,0,,Are you feeling at all degraded or oppressed?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.15,0:41:22.26,ENG,710,0,0,0,,Uh... a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.36,0:41:24.15,ENG,711,0,0,0,,We don't even have dental.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.15,0:41:25.56,ENG,712,0,0,0,,They don't even have dental.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.06,0:41:28.16,ENG,713,0,0,0,,Okay, we'll just have a look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.36,0:41:29.57,ENG,714,0,0,0,,Oh. By the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.57,0:41:32.56,ENG,715,0,0,0,,I think it'd be better if the Fairy Godmother didn't know we were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.66,0:41:33.97,ENG,716,0,0,0,,Know what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.56,0:41:38.66,ENG,717,0,0,0,,-  Stop it. - Of course. Go right in.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.66,0:42:10.46,ENG,718,0,0,0,,A drop of desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.67,0:42:13.16,ENG,719,0,0,0,,Naughty!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.86,0:42:16.46,ENG,720,0,0,0,,A pinch of passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.56,0:42:25.36,ENG,721,0,0,0,,And just a hint of...Iust!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.96,0:42:29.77,ENG,722,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.37,0:42:32.76,ENG,723,0,0,0,,Sorry to barge in like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.87,0:42:35.57,ENG,724,0,0,0,,What in Grimm's name are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.66,0:42:41.27,ENG,725,0,0,0,,Well, it seems that Fiona's not exactly happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.36,0:42:45.26,ENG,726,0,0,0,,And there's some question as to why that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.95,0:42:47.86,ENG,727,0,0,0,,Well, let's explore that, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.36,0:42:52.67,ENG,728,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.67,0:42:53.87,ENG,729,0,0,0,,P, P, P... Princess. Cinderella.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.96,0:42:55.97,ENG,730,0,0,0,,Here we are. "Lived happily ever after." Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.07,0:42:58.57,ENG,731,0,0,0,,No ogres!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.07,0:43:00.77,ENG,732,0,0,0,,Let's see. Snow White.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.87,0:43:04.17,ENG,733,0,0,0,,A handsome prince. Oh, no ogres.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.67,0:43:06.87,ENG,734,0,0,0,,Sleeping Beauty. Oh, no ogres!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.97,0:43:08.97,ENG,735,0,0,0,,Hansel and Gretel? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.97,0:43:10.28,ENG,736,0,0,0,,Thumbelina? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.38,0:43:12.88,ENG,737,0,0,0,,The Golden Bird, the Little Mermaid, Pretty Woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.88,0:43:16.97,ENG,738,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no, no! You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.37,0:43:20.17,ENG,739,0,0,0,,ogres don't live happily ever after.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.17,0:43:21.17,ENG,740,0,0,0,,All right, look, lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.17,0:43:26.07,ENG,741,0,0,0,,Don't you point... those dirty green sausages at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.66,0:43:30.56,ENG,742,0,0,0,,Your Monte Cristo and coffee. Oh! Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.17,0:43:34.56,ENG,743,0,0,0,,Ah... that's okay.We were just leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.26,0:43:37.86,ENG,744,0,0,0,,Very sorry to have wasted your time, Miss Godmother.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.86,0:43:39.76,ENG,745,0,0,0,,Just... go.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.17,0:43:41.16,ENG,746,0,0,0,,Come on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.97,0:43:58.87,ENG,747,0,0,0,,TGlF, eh, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.87,0:44:03.58,ENG,748,0,0,0,,Working hard or hardly working, eh, Mac?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.48,0:44:07.78,ENG,749,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.77,0:44:14.57,ENG,750,0,0,0,,Get your fine Corinthian footwear
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.57,0:44:16.57,ENG,751,0,0,0,,and your cat cheeks out of my face!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.57,0:44:17.57,ENG,752,0,0,0,,Man, that stinks!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.87,0:44:21.68,ENG,753,0,0,0,,You don't exactly smell like a basket of roses.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.36,0:44:26.87,ENG,754,0,0,0,,Well, one of these has got to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.97,0:44:29.37,ENG,755,0,0,0,,I was just concocting this very plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.37,0:44:32.07,ENG,756,0,0,0,,Already our minds are becoming one.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.17,0:44:34.38,ENG,757,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.38,0:44:36.57,ENG,758,0,0,0,,If we need an expert on licking ourselves, we'll give you a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.27,0:44:39.07,ENG,759,0,0,0,,Shrek, this is a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.27,0:44:42.47,ENG,760,0,0,0,,Look. Make yourself useful and go keep watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.57,0:44:45.58,ENG,761,0,0,0,,Puss, do you think you could get to those on top?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.67,0:44:46.77,ENG,762,0,0,0,,No problema, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.77,0:44:49.37,ENG,763,0,0,0,,In one of my nine lives,I was the great cat
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.37,0:44:51.38,ENG,764,0,0,0,,burglar of Santiago de Compostela.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.58,0:44:53.78,ENG,765,0,0,0,,Shrek, are you off your nut?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.87,0:44:55.98,ENG,766,0,0,0,,Donkey, keep watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.07,0:44:58.08,ENG,767,0,0,0,,Keep watch? Yeah, I'll keep watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.49,0:45:00.47,ENG,768,0,0,0,,I'll watch that wicked witch come
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.47,0:45:01.58,ENG,769,0,0,0,,and whammy a world of hurt up your backside.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.58,0:45:04.38,ENG,770,0,0,0,,I'll laugh, too. I'll be giggling to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.58,0:45:05.57,ENG,771,0,0,0,,What do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.57,0:45:07.07,ENG,772,0,0,0,,Toad Stool Softener?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.07,0:45:08.58,ENG,773,0,0,0,,I'm sure a nice
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.58,0:45:11.57,ENG,774,0,0,0,,BM is the perfect solution for marital problems
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.77,0:45:12.88,ENG,775,0,0,0,,Elfa Seltzer?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.58,0:45:14.48,ENG,776,0,0,0,,Hex Lax?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.77,0:45:17.26,ENG,777,0,0,0,,No! Try "handsome."
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.37,0:45:20.18,ENG,778,0,0,0,,Sorry. No handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.97,0:45:23.77,ENG,779,0,0,0,,Hey! How about "Happily Ever After"?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.48,0:45:26.27,ENG,780,0,0,0,,Well, what does it do?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.88,0:45:29.47,ENG,781,0,0,0,,It says "Beauty Divine."
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.58,0:45:32.87,ENG,782,0,0,0,,In some cultures, donkeys are revered as the wisest of creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.98,0:45:34.78,ENG,783,0,0,0,,Especially us talking ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.68,0:45:36.98,ENG,784,0,0,0,,Donkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.08,0:45:40.58,ENG,785,0,0,0,,That'll have to do. We've got company.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.89,0:45:49.19,ENG,786,0,0,0,,Can we get on with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.88,0:45:53.18,ENG,787,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.87,0:46:04.07,ENG,788,0,0,0,,Nice catch, Donkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.17,0:46:06.07,ENG,789,0,0,0,,Finally! A good use for your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.08,0:46:09.98,ENG,790,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.78,0:46:11.97,ENG,791,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.48,0:46:20.18,ENG,792,0,0,0,,∮ You spurn my natural emotions ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.28,0:46:24.08,ENG,793,0,0,0,,∮ You make me feel like dirt and I'm hurt ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.48,0:46:30.98,ENG,794,0,0,0,,∮ And if I start a commotion ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.98,0:46:34.69,ENG,795,0,0,0,,∮ I run the risk of losing you and that's worse ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.28,0:46:41.99,ENG,796,0,0,0,,∮ Ever fallen in love with someone, ever fallen in love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.09,0:46:44.58,ENG,797,0,0,0,,∮ In love with someone, ever fallen in love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.69,0:46:47.98,ENG,798,0,0,0,,∮ In love with someone you shouldn 't have fallen in love with ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.48,0:46:57.98,ENG,799,0,0,0,,∮ Ever fallen in love with someone, ever fallen in love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.08,0:47:00.78,ENG,800,0,0,0,,∮ In love with someone, ever fallen in love ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.88,0:47:03.38,ENG,801,0,0,0,,∮ With someone you shouldn 't have fallen in love with ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.88,0:47:06.69,ENG,802,0,0,0,,∮ Fallen in love with ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.98,0:47:12.58,ENG,803,0,0,0,,∮ Ever fallen in love with someone you shouldn 't have fallen in love with ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.99,0:47:15.58,ENG,804,0,0,0,,I don't care whose fault it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.58,0:47:17.58,ENG,805,0,0,0,,Just get this place cleaned up!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.58,0:47:18.59,ENG,806,0,0,0,,Fairy Godmother
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.79,0:47:20.38,ENG,807,0,0,0,,And somebody
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.38,0:47:23.59,ENG,808,0,0,0,,bring me something deep fried and smothered in chocolate!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.39,0:47:25.29,ENG,809,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.29,0:47:27.59,ENG,810,0,0,0,,Charming. Sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.79,0:47:31.29,ENG,811,0,0,0,,This isn't a good time, pumpkin. Mama's working.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.39,0:47:32.99,ENG,812,0,0,0,,Whoa, what happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.99,0:47:34.79,ENG,813,0,0,0,,The ogre, that's what!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.79,0:47:35.79,ENG,814,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.79,0:47:36.89,ENG,815,0,0,0,,Where is he, Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.98,0:47:39.68,ENG,816,0,0,0,,I shall rend his head from his shoulders!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.68,0:47:41.89,ENG,817,0,0,0,,I will smite him where he stands!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.89,0:47:45.58,ENG,818,0,0,0,,He will rue the very day he stole my kingdom from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.79,0:47:50.29,ENG,819,0,0,0,,Oh, put it away, Junior! You're still going to be king.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.38,0:47:53.38,ENG,820,0,0,0,,We'll just have to come up with something smarter.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.49,0:47:56.58,ENG,821,0,0,0,,Pardon. Um...Everything is accounted for,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.58,0:47:59.39,ENG,822,0,0,0,,Fairy Godmother,except for one potion.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.39,0:48:00.39,ENG,823,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.59,0:48:06.49,ENG,824,0,0,0,,I do believe we can make this work to our advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.79,0:48:12.19,ENG,825,0,0,0,,"Happily Ever After Potion. Maximum strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.48,0:48:14.29,ENG,826,0,0,0,,"For you and your true love.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.39,0:48:16.60,ENG,827,0,0,0,,"If one of you drinks this,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.60,0:48:20.39,ENG,828,0,0,0,,you both will be fine. "Happiness, comfort and beauty divine."
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.39,0:48:21.59,ENG,829,0,0,0,,You both will be fine?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.70,0:48:24.90,ENG,830,0,0,0,,I guess it means it'll affect Fiona, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.39,0:48:27.09,ENG,831,0,0,0,,Hey, man, this don't feel right.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.19,0:48:29.09,ENG,832,0,0,0,,My donkey senses are tingling all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.09,0:48:31.69,ENG,833,0,0,0,,Drop that jug o' voodoo and let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.79,0:48:35.49,ENG,834,0,0,0,,It says, "Beauty Divine." How bad can it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.79,0:48:40.68,ENG,835,0,0,0,,See, you're allergic to that stuff. You'll have a reaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.68,0:48:44.18,ENG,836,0,0,0,,And if you think that I'll be smearing Vapor Rub over your chest,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.18,0:48:44.98,ENG,837,0,0,0,,think again!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.29,0:48:48.39,ENG,838,0,0,0,,Boss, just in case there is something wrong with the potion...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.49,0:48:50.09,ENG,839,0,0,0,,allow me to take the first sip.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.09,0:48:53.59,ENG,840,0,0,0,,It would be an honor to lay my life on the line for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.70,0:48:55.40,ENG,841,0,0,0,,Oh, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.40,0:48:56.39,ENG,842,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.39,0:48:57.89,ENG,843,0,0,0,,If there'll be any animal testing,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.09,0:48:59.59,ENG,844,0,0,0,,I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.59,0:49:02.59,ENG,845,0,0,0,,That's the best friend's job. Now give me that bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.50,0:49:08.40,ENG,846,0,0,0,,How do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.59,0:49:12.00,ENG,847,0,0,0,,I don't feel any different.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.00,0:49:13.29,ENG,848,0,0,0,,I look any different?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.40,0:49:14.90,ENG,849,0,0,0,,You still look like an ass to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.39,0:49:18.30,ENG,850,0,0,0,,Maybe it doesn't work on donkeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.79,0:49:22.99,ENG,851,0,0,0,,Well, here's to us, Fiona.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.10,0:49:24.00,ENG,852,0,0,0,,Shrek?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.09,0:49:25.89,ENG,853,0,0,0,,You drink that, there's no going back.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.09,0:49:26.79,ENG,854,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.89,0:49:28.89,ENG,855,0,0,0,,-  No more wallowing in the mud? - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.28,0:49:30.50,ENG,856,0,0,0,,No more itchy butt crack?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.50,0:49:31.49,ENG,857,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.49,0:49:32.59,ENG,858,0,0,0,,But you love being an ogre!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.59,0:49:33.59,ENG,859,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.99,0:49:38.99,ENG,860,0,0,0,,But I love Fiona more.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.80,0:49:41.80,ENG,861,0,0,0,,Shrek, no! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.30,0:49:57.40,ENG,862,0,0,0,,Got to be...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.40,0:49:59.70,ENG,863,0,0,0,,I think you grabbed the "Farty Ever After" potion.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.71,0:50:01.21,ENG,864,0,0,0,,Maybe it's a dud.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.80,0:50:04.70,ENG,865,0,0,0,,Or maybe Fiona and l were never meant to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.10,0:50:11.79,ENG,866,0,0,0,,Uh-oh. What did I tell you? I feel something coming on.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.90,0:50:16.19,ENG,867,0,0,0,,I don't want to die. I don't want to die. I don't want to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.19,0:50:18.79,ENG,868,0,0,0,,Oh, sweet sister, mother of mercy. I'm melting!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.79,0:50:20.60,ENG,869,0,0,0,,I'm melting!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.60,0:50:22.79,ENG,870,0,0,0,,It's just the rain, Donkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.90,0:51:11.10,ENG,871,0,0,0,,Don't worry. Things seem bad because it's dark and rainy
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.20,0:51:13.70,ENG,872,0,0,0,,and Fiona's father hired a sleazy hitman to whack you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.30,0:51:15.79,ENG,873,0,0,0,,It'll be better in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.10,0:51:17.10,ENG,874,0,0,0,,You'll see...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.40,0:51:20.40,ENG,875,0,0,0,,∮ The sun'll come out... ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.19,0:51:23.40,ENG,876,0,0,0,,∮ Tomorrow ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.60,0:51:25.40,ENG,877,0,0,0,,∮ Bet your bottom... ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.61,0:51:27.00,ENG,878,0,0,0,,Bet my bottom?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.21,0:51:28.50,ENG,879,0,0,0,,I'm coming, Elizabeth!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.11,0:51:30.20,ENG,880,0,0,0,,Donkey?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.70,0:51:32.31,ENG,881,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.70,0:51:35.50,ENG,882,0,0,0,,Hey, boss. Let's shave him.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.50,0:51:37.30,ENG,883,0,0,0,,D-Donkey?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.11,0:51:48.61,ENG,884,0,0,0,,There you are! We missed you at dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.60,0:51:50.81,ENG,885,0,0,0,,What is it, darling?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.81,0:51:54.61,ENG,886,0,0,0,,Dad...I've been thinking about what you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.40,0:51:57.91,ENG,887,0,0,0,,And I'm going to set things right.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.01,0:52:00.40,ENG,888,0,0,0,,Ah! Excellent! That's my girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.40,0:52:02.50,ENG,889,0,0,0,,It was a mistake to bring Shrek here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.60,0:52:05.50,ENG,890,0,0,0,,I'm going to go out and find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.30,0:52:09.11,ENG,891,0,0,0,,And then we'll go back to the swamp where we belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.71,0:52:14.22,ENG,892,0,0,0,,Fiona, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.41,0:52:17.61,ENG,893,0,0,0,,Let's not be rash, darling. You can't go anywhere right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.91,0:52:21.90,ENG,894,0,0,0,,Fiona!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.79,0:53:04.42,ENG,895,0,0,0,,Look, I told you he was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.42,0:53:06.12,ENG,896,0,0,0,,Look at him! Quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.51,0:53:07.90,ENG,897,0,0,0,,Look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.81,0:53:10.81,ENG,898,0,0,0,,Good morning, sleepyhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.71,0:53:14.61,ENG,899,0,0,0,,Good morning! We love your kitty!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.00,0:53:16.50,ENG,900,0,0,0,,Oh... My head...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.61,0:53:18.60,ENG,901,0,0,0,,Here, I fetched a pail of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.71,0:53:20.31,ENG,902,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.41,0:53:30.32,ENG,903,0,0,0,,A cute button nose?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.11,0:53:32.81,ENG,904,0,0,0,,Thick, wavy locks?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.72,0:53:36.01,ENG,905,0,0,0,,Taut, round buttocks?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.51,0:53:38.21,ENG,906,0,0,0,,I'm... I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.32,0:53:39.21,ENG,907,0,0,0,,Gorgeous!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.32,0:53:41.30,ENG,908,0,0,0,,- I'll say. - I'm Jill. What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.41,0:53:42.61,ENG,909,0,0,0,,Um... Shrek.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.80,0:53:44.31,ENG,910,0,0,0,,Shrek?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.42,0:53:45.61,ENG,911,0,0,0,,Wow. Are you from Europe?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.40,0:53:46.40,ENG,912,0,0,0,,-  You're tense. - I want to rub his shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.40,0:53:50.60,ENG,913,0,0,0,,-  I got it covered. - I don't have anything to rub.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.60,0:53:52.10,ENG,914,0,0,0,,Get in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.10,0:53:54.11,ENG,915,0,0,0,,Have you seen my donkey?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.11,0:53:55.41,ENG,916,0,0,0,,Who are you calling donkey?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.12,0:53:58.82,ENG,917,0,0,0,,Donkey? You're a...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.91,0:54:01.50,ENG,918,0,0,0,,A stallion, baby! I can whinny.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.61,0:54:03.61,ENG,919,0,0,0,,I can count.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.31,0:54:05.21,ENG,920,0,0,0,,Look at me, Shrek!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.31,0:54:07.12,ENG,921,0,0,0,,I'm trotting!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.91,0:54:10.61,ENG,922,0,0,0,,That's some quality potion. What's in that stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.61,0:54:14.21,ENG,923,0,0,0,,"Oh, don't take the potion, Mr. Boss, it's very bad."
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.12,0:54:19.81,ENG,924,0,0,0,,"Warning: Side effects may include burning, itching, oozing, weeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.81,0:54:23.71,ENG,925,0,0,0,,"Not intended for heart patients or those with... nervous disorders."
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.81,0:54:26.52,ENG,926,0,0,0,,I'm trotting, I'm trotting in place! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.71,0:54:29.52,ENG,927,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.71,0:54:33.21,ENG,928,0,0,0,,Senor? "To make the effects of this potion permanent,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.31,0:54:35.91,ENG,929,0,0,0,,"the drinker must obtain
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.91,0:54:37.02,ENG,930,0,0,0,,his true love's kiss by midnight."
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.21,0:54:40.01,ENG,931,0,0,0,,Midnight? Why is it always midnight?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.22,0:54:42.71,ENG,932,0,0,0,,-  Pick me! I'll be your true love! - I'll be your true love.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.81,0:54:45.01,ENG,933,0,0,0,,I'll be true... enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.41,0:54:48.72,ENG,934,0,0,0,,Look, ladies, I already have a true love.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.11,0:54:51.52,ENG,935,0,0,0,,And take it from me, Boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.52,0:54:54.41,ENG,936,0,0,0,,You are going to have one satisfied Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.52,0:54:57.42,ENG,937,0,0,0,,And let's face it. You are a lot easier on the eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.42,0:55:00.12,ENG,938,0,0,0,,Inside you're the same old mean, salty...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.21,0:55:03.62,ENG,939,0,0,0,,...cantankerous, foul,angry ogre you always been.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.62,0:55:06.62,ENG,940,0,0,0,,And you're still the same annoying donkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.62,0:55:07.62,ENG,941,0,0,0,,Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.43,0:55:14.52,ENG,942,0,0,0,,Well...Look out, Princess. Here comes the new me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.72,0:55:18.62,ENG,943,0,0,0,,First things first.We need to get you out of those clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.13,0:55:24.41,ENG,944,0,0,0,,-  Ready? - Ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.01,0:55:30.91,ENG,945,0,0,0,,Driver, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.01,0:55:33.61,ENG,946,0,0,0,,Oh, God! Help me, please! My racing days are over!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.82,0:55:35.61,ENG,947,0,0,0,,I'm blind! Tell the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.61,0:55:37.62,ENG,948,0,0,0,,Will I ever play the violin again?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.62,0:55:41.72,ENG,949,0,0,0,,You poor creature! Is there anything I can do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.02,0:55:43.82,ENG,950,0,0,0,,Well, I guess there is one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.13,0:55:47.22,ENG,951,0,0,0,,Take off the powdered wig and step away from your drawers.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.12,0:55:53.42,ENG,952,0,0,0,,-  Not bad. - Not bad at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.92,0:56:04.42,ENG,953,0,0,0,,Father? Is everything all right, Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.02,0:56:11.32,ENG,954,0,0,0,,Thank you, gentlemen!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.63,0:56:13.72,ENG,955,0,0,0,,Someday, I will repay you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.83,0:56:17.12,ENG,956,0,0,0,,Unless, of course, I can't find you or if I forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.62,0:56:20.13,ENG,957,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.13,0:56:22.62,ENG,958,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.82,0:56:24.81,ENG,959,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.12,0:56:26.11,ENG,960,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.92,0:56:40.53,ENG,961,0,0,0,,∮ Turn and face the strange, Ch-Ch-Changes ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.72,0:56:43.82,ENG,962,0,0,0,,∮ Don't wanna be a richer one ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.92,0:56:47.03,ENG,963,0,0,0,,∮ Ch-Ch-Ch-Ch-Changes ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.03,0:56:50.13,ENG,964,0,0,0,,∮ Turn and face the strange, Ch-Ch-Changes ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.13,0:56:53.23,ENG,965,0,0,0,,∮ Just gonna have to be a different man ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.23,0:56:58.93,ENG,966,0,0,0,,∮ Time may change me,  But I can't trace time ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.53,0:57:02.63,ENG,967,0,0,0,,Halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.72,0:57:03.82,ENG,968,0,0,0,,Tell Princess Fiona
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.82,0:57:06.12,ENG,969,0,0,0,,her husband, Sir Shrek, is here to see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.72,0:57:13.92,ENG,970,0,0,0,,∮ Still don't know what I was looking for ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.02,0:57:19.13,ENG,971,0,0,0,,∮ And my time was running wild, a million dead-end streets ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.23,0:57:22.33,ENG,972,0,0,0,,∮ Every time I thought I'd got it made ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.42,0:57:25.13,ENG,973,0,0,0,,∮ It seemed the taste was not so sweet ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.13,0:57:27.13,ENG,974,0,0,0,,∮ Ch-Ch-Ch-Ch-Changes ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.83,0:57:28.83,ENG,975,0,0,0,,∮ Turn and face the strange ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.13,0:57:30.92,ENG,976,0,0,0,,- Fiona? - Shrek?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.52,0:57:40.14,ENG,977,0,0,0,,∮ Time may change me,  But I can't trace time ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.14,0:57:41.23,ENG,978,0,0,0,,Fiona?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.63,0:57:46.33,ENG,979,0,0,0,,Hello, handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.73,0:57:49.23,ENG,980,0,0,0,,Shrek!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.62,0:57:50.53,ENG,981,0,0,0,,Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.53,0:57:52.33,ENG,982,0,0,0,,Donkey?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.53,0:57:54.53,ENG,983,0,0,0,,Wow! That potion worked on you, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.82,0:57:56.03,ENG,984,0,0,0,,What potion?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.13,0:57:59.43,ENG,985,0,0,0,,Shrek and I took some magic potion. And well...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.43,0:58:01.93,ENG,986,0,0,0,,Now, we're sexy!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.63,0:58:04.32,ENG,987,0,0,0,,Shrek?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.42,0:58:11.23,ENG,988,0,0,0,,For you, baby... I could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.23,0:58:12.44,ENG,989,0,0,0,,Yeah, you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.53,0:58:13.94,ENG,990,0,0,0,,Donkey, where is Shrek?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.03,0:58:15.44,ENG,991,0,0,0,,He went inside looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.23,0:58:19.03,ENG,992,0,0,0,,Shrek?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.93,0:58:20.93,ENG,993,0,0,0,,Fiona!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.03,0:58:22.54,ENG,994,0,0,0,,Fiona!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.43,0:58:26.53,ENG,995,0,0,0,,You want to dance, pretty boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.24,0:58:30.83,ENG,996,0,0,0,,Are you going so soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.94,0:58:33.24,ENG,997,0,0,0,,Don't you want to see your wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.44,0:58:35.44,ENG,998,0,0,0,,Fiona?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.84,0:58:38.84,ENG,999,0,0,0,,Shrek?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.43,0:58:41.83,ENG,1000,0,0,0,,Aye, Fiona. It is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.94,0:58:43.43,ENG,1001,0,0,0,,What happened to your voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.53,0:58:47.42,ENG,1002,0,0,0,,The potion changed a lot of things, Fiona.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.23,0:58:50.13,ENG,1003,0,0,0,,But not the way I feel about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.63,0:58:51.73,ENG,1004,0,0,0,,Fiona?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.93,0:58:54.33,ENG,1005,0,0,0,,Charming?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.33,0:58:56.03,ENG,1006,0,0,0,,Do you think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.64,0:58:57.33,ENG,1007,0,0,0,,Dad
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.43,0:58:59.53,ENG,1008,0,0,0,,I was so hoping you'd approve.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.93,0:59:01.44,ENG,1009,0,0,0,,Um... Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.64,0:59:03.14,ENG,1010,0,0,0,,Mom, it's me, Shrek.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.44,0:59:07.03,ENG,1011,0,0,0,,I know you never get a second chance at a first impression,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.23,0:59:09.83,ENG,1012,0,0,0,,but, well, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.03,0:59:16.53,ENG,1013,0,0,0,,Fiona! Fiona!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.44,0:59:19.94,ENG,1014,0,0,0,,Fiona!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.55,0:59:23.04,ENG,1015,0,0,0,,-  Fiona! - Fiona, Fiona! Ho-ho-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.34,0:59:27.74,ENG,1016,0,0,0,,Oh, shoot! I don't think they can hear us, pigeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.33,0:59:33.64,ENG,1017,0,0,0,,Don't you think you've already messed her life up enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.33,0:59:36.43,ENG,1018,0,0,0,,I just wanted her to be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.65,0:59:41.03,ENG,1019,0,0,0,,And now she can be.And now she can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.44,0:59:45.23,ENG,1020,0,0,0,,She's finally found the prince of her dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.23,0:59:48.73,ENG,1021,0,0,0,,But look at me. Look what I've done for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.83,0:59:52.44,ENG,1022,0,0,0,,It's time you stop living in a fairy tale, Shrek.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.74,0:59:56.74,ENG,1023,0,0,0,,She's a princess, and you're an ogre.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.34,1:00:01.14,ENG,1024,0,0,0,,That's something no amount of potion will ever change.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.54,1:00:11.35,ENG,1025,0,0,0,,But...I love her.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.95,1:00:17.04,ENG,1026,0,0,0,,If you really love her...you'll let her go.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.64,1:00:17.74,ENG,1027,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.74,1:00:23.94,ENG,1028,0,0,0,,Shrek?  Senor.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.04,1:00:25.44,ENG,1029,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.54,1:00:26.64,ENG,1030,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.14,1:00:35.63,ENG,1031,0,0,0,,You wouldn't have had anything to do with this,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.63,1:00:37.64,ENG,1032,0,0,0,,would you, Harold?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.04,1:00:46.14,ENG,1033,0,0,0,,∮ People just ain't no good ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.64,1:00:52.24,ENG,1034,0,0,0,,∮ I think that's well understood ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.35,1:00:53.65,ENG,1035,0,0,0,,There you go, boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.65,1:00:55.64,ENG,1036,0,0,0,,Just leave the bottle, Doris.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.75,1:00:58.34,ENG,1037,0,0,0,,Hey. Why the long face?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.44,1:01:02.25,ENG,1038,0,0,0,,It was all just a stupid mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.74,1:01:06.55,ENG,1039,0,0,0,,I never should have rescued her from that tower in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.95,1:01:10.54,ENG,1040,0,0,0,,I hate Mondays.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.74,1:01:14.45,ENG,1041,0,0,0,,I can't believe you'd walk away from the best thing that happened to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.55,1:01:18.65,ENG,1042,0,0,0,,What choice do I have? She loves that pretty boy
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.75,1:01:19.94,ENG,1043,0,0,0,,Prince Charming.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.94,1:01:22.34,ENG,1044,0,0,0,,Come on. Is he really that good-looking?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.34,1:01:24.44,ENG,1045,0,0,0,,Are you kidding? He's gorgeous!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.55,1:01:27.44,ENG,1046,0,0,0,,He has a face that looks like it was carved by angels.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.53,1:01:29.84,ENG,1047,0,0,0,,Oh. He sounds dreamy.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.03,1:01:34.04,ENG,1048,0,0,0,,You know shockingly, this isn't making me feel any better.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.65,1:01:39.85,ENG,1049,0,0,0,,Look, guys. It's for the best.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.35,1:01:44.55,ENG,1050,0,0,0,,Mom and Dad approve,and Fiona gets the man she's always dreamed of.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.15,1:01:46.94,ENG,1051,0,0,0,,Everybody wins.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.45,1:01:51.25,ENG,1052,0,0,0,,Except for you. I don't get it, Shrek.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.45,1:01:53.45,ENG,1053,0,0,0,,You love Fiona.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.45,1:01:57.55,ENG,1054,0,0,0,,Aye. And that's why I have to let her go.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.04,1:01:59.66,ENG,1055,0,0,0,,Excuse me,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.66,1:02:04.14,ENG,1056,0,0,0,,- is she here? - She's, uh... in the back.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.45,1:02:07.15,ENG,1057,0,0,0,,Oh, hello again.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.25,1:02:13.95,ENG,1058,0,0,0,,Fairy Godmother. Charming.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.24,1:02:17.74,ENG,1059,0,0,0,,You'd better have a good reason for dragging us down here, Harold.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.95,1:02:23.64,ENG,1060,0,0,0,,Well, I'm afraid Fiona isn't really... warming up to Prince Charming.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.05,1:02:26.05,ENG,1061,0,0,0,,FYl, not my fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.15,1:02:27.66,ENG,1062,0,0,0,,No, of course it's not, dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.66,1:02:27.66,ENG,1063,0,0,0,,I mean,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.66,1:02:30.65,ENG,1064,0,0,0,,how charming can I be when I have to pretend I'm
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.65,1:02:31.86,ENG,1065,0,0,0,,that dreadful ogre?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.95,1:02:34.84,ENG,1066,0,0,0,,Perhaps
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.95,1:02:31.95,ENG,1067,0,0,0,,No, no, it's nobody's fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.84,1:02:37.35,ENG,1068,0,0,0,,it's best if we just call the whole thing off, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.45,1:02:38.24,ENG,1069,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.24,1:02:41.44,ENG,1070,0,0,0,,You can't force someone to fall in love!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.64,1:02:44.66,ENG,1071,0,0,0,,I beg to differ. I do it all the time!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.26,1:02:47.25,ENG,1072,0,0,0,,Have Fiona drink this
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.25,1:02:49.65,ENG,1073,0,0,0,,and she'll fall in love with the first man she kisses,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.95,1:02:52.15,ENG,1074,0,0,0,,which will be Charming.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.15,1:02:54.55,ENG,1075,0,0,0,,Umm... no.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.65,1:02:55.95,ENG,1076,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.05,1:02:58.44,ENG,1077,0,0,0,,I can't. I won't do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.44,1:03:00.14,ENG,1078,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, you will.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.45,1:03:03.65,ENG,1079,0,0,0,,If you remember, I helped you with your happily ever after.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.85,1:03:07.35,ENG,1080,0,0,0,,And I can take it away just as easily.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.55,1:03:09.14,ENG,1081,0,0,0,,Is that what you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.35,1:03:10.44,ENG,1082,0,0,0,,Is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.55,1:03:12.85,ENG,1083,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.94,1:03:15.95,ENG,1084,0,0,0,,Good boy. Now, we have to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.05,1:03:18.36,ENG,1085,0,0,0,,I need to do Charming's hair before the ball.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.36,1:03:21.85,ENG,1086,0,0,0,,He can never get to the back.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.36,1:03:18.36,ENG,1087,0,0,0,,He's hopeless. He's all high in the front.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.85,1:03:23.76,ENG,1088,0,0,0,,You need someone to do the back.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.85,1:03:25.35,ENG,1089,0,0,0,,Oh. Thank you, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.35,1:03:26.55,ENG,1090,0,0,0,,Mother?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.55,1:03:30.05,ENG,1091,0,0,0,,Um... Mary! A talking horse!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.15,1:03:31.56,ENG,1092,0,0,0,,The ogre!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.26,1:03:34.86,ENG,1093,0,0,0,,Stop them! Thieves!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.86,1:03:37.86,ENG,1094,0,0,0,,Bandits! Stop them!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.76,1:03:41.85,ENG,1095,0,0,0,,The abs are fab and it's gluteus to the maximus
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.85,1:03:44.86,ENG,1096,0,0,0,,here at tonight's Far, Far Away Royal Ball blowout!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.86,1:03:46.45,ENG,1097,0,0,0,,The coaches are lined up as the cream of the crop pours out of them
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.56,1:03:49.75,ENG,1098,0,0,0,,Like Miss Muffet's curds and whey.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.65,1:03:55.16,ENG,1099,0,0,0,,Everyone who's anyone has turned out
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.16,1:03:57.75,ENG,1100,0,0,0,,And, oh my, the outfits look gorgeous!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.75,1:04:02.06,ENG,1101,0,0,0,,Look! Hansel and Gretel! What the heck are the crumbs for?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.25,1:04:05.46,ENG,1102,0,0,0,,And right behind them, Tom Thumb and Thumbelina!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.46,1:04:07.45,ENG,1103,0,0,0,,Oh, aren't they adorable!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.25,1:04:10.66,ENG,1104,0,0,0,,Here comes Sleeping Beauty!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.26,1:04:12.96,ENG,1105,0,0,0,,Tired old thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.06,1:04:16.86,ENG,1106,0,0,0,,Who's this? Who's this? Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.86,1:04:22.35,ENG,1107,0,0,0,,Oh. It's the one, it's the only...It's the Fairy Godmother!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.74,1:04:26.26,ENG,1108,0,0,0,,Hello, Far, Far Away!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.26,1:04:29.36,ENG,1109,0,0,0,,Can I get a whoop whoop?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.86,1:04:36.66,ENG,1110,0,0,0,,May all your endings be happy and...Well, you know the rest!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.66,1:04:40.65,ENG,1111,0,0,0,,We'll be right back with the Royal Far, Far Away Ball
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.65,1:04:41.66,ENG,1112,0,0,0,,after these messages.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.86,1:04:45.56,ENG,1113,0,0,0,,I hate these ball shows.They bore me to tears.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.75,1:04:47.16,ENG,1114,0,0,0,,Flip over to Wheel Of T orture!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.26,1:04:49.66,ENG,1115,0,0,0,,I'm not flipping anywhere, sir,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.66,1:04:51.65,ENG,1116,0,0,0,,until I see Shrek and Fiona.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.65,1:04:53.66,ENG,1117,0,0,0,,Whizzes on you guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.66,1:04:55.65,ENG,1118,0,0,0,,Hey, mice, pass me a buffalo wing!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.95,1:04:58.46,ENG,1119,0,0,0,,No, to your left. Your left!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.36,1:05:02.95,ENG,1120,0,0,0,,Tonight on "Knights"...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.95,1:05:04.66,ENG,1121,0,0,0,,Now here's a good show!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.66,1:05:06.56,ENG,1122,0,0,0,,We got a white bronco heading east into the forest.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.66,1:05:07.85,ENG,1123,0,0,0,,Requesting backup.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.96,1:05:11.66,ENG,1124,0,0,0,,It's time to teach these madcap mammals
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.66,1:05:13.67,ENG,1125,0,0,0,,their "devil may mare" attitudes just won't fly.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.66,1:05:18.67,ENG,1126,0,0,0,,Why you grabbing me? Police brutality!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.77,1:05:22.26,ENG,1127,0,0,0,,- I have to talk to Princess Fiona! - We warned you!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.56,1:05:26.47,ENG,1128,0,0,0,,Did someone let the cat out of the bag?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.56,1:05:28.66,ENG,1129,0,0,0,,You capitalist pig dogs!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.67,1:05:31.66,ENG,1130,0,0,0,,Catnip!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.67,1:05:35.26,ENG,1131,0,0,0,,That's not mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.46,1:05:38.66,ENG,1132,0,0,0,,Find Princess Fiona!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.16,1:05:40.16,ENG,1133,0,0,0,,I'm a donkey!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.16,1:05:42.66,ENG,1134,0,0,0,,Tell her Shrek... I'm her husband, Shrek!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.66,1:05:43.66,ENG,1135,0,0,0,,Quick!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.06,1:05:45.45,ENG,1136,0,0,0,,Rewind it!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.46,1:05:48.96,ENG,1137,0,0,0,,I'm her husband, Shrek! Ow!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.07,1:06:18.17,ENG,1138,0,0,0,,Darling?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.26,1:06:20.87,ENG,1139,0,0,0,,Ah. I thought I might find you here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.87,1:06:24.66,ENG,1140,0,0,0,,How about a nice hot cup of tea before the ball?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.86,1:06:27.36,ENG,1141,0,0,0,,I'm not going.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.47,1:06:30.67,ENG,1142,0,0,0,,The whole Kingdom's turned out to celebrate your marriage.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.76,1:06:34.76,ENG,1143,0,0,0,,There's just one problem. That's not my husband.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.96,1:06:37.96,ENG,1144,0,0,0,,I mean, look at him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.36,1:06:44.27,ENG,1145,0,0,0,,Yes, he is a bit different,but people change for the ones they love.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.47,1:06:47.36,ENG,1146,0,0,0,,You'd be surprised how much I changed for your mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.47,1:06:51.67,ENG,1147,0,0,0,,Change? He's completely lost his mind!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.76,1:06:55.16,ENG,1148,0,0,0,,Why not come down to the ball and give him another chance?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.16,1:06:58.27,ENG,1149,0,0,0,,You might find you like this new Shrek.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.47,1:07:01.18,ENG,1150,0,0,0,,But it's the old one I fell in love with, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.58,1:07:05.07,ENG,1151,0,0,0,,I'd give anything to have him back.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.07,1:07:11.16,ENG,1152,0,0,0,,Darling. That's mine. Decaf.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.16,1:07:13.16,ENG,1153,0,0,0,,Otherwise I'm up all night.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.76,1:07:20.96,ENG,1154,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.16,1:07:25.66,ENG,1155,0,0,0,,I got to get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.66,1:07:28.26,ENG,1156,0,0,0,,You can't lock us up like this! Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.47,1:07:29.67,ENG,1157,0,0,0,,What about my Miranda rights?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.67,1:07:32.67,ENG,1158,0,0,0,,You're supposed to say I have the right to remain silent.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.67,1:07:34.47,ENG,1159,0,0,0,,Nobody said I have the right to remain silent!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.47,1:07:37.67,ENG,1160,0,0,0,,You have the right to remain silent.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.67,1:07:40.07,ENG,1161,0,0,0,,What you lack is the capacity.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.17,1:07:43.97,ENG,1162,0,0,0,,I must hold on before l, too, go totally mad.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.07,1:07:45.17,ENG,1163,0,0,0,,Shrek?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.36,1:07:46.57,ENG,1164,0,0,0,,Donkey?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.67,1:07:48.47,ENG,1165,0,0,0,,Too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.57,1:07:51.78,ENG,1166,0,0,0,,Gingy! Pinocchio! Get us out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.28,1:07:55.77,ENG,1167,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.47,1:07:59.27,ENG,1168,0,0,0,,Fire in ze hole!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.18,1:08:19.46,ENG,1169,0,0,0,,Look out below!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.96,1:08:23.98,ENG,1170,0,0,0,,Quick! Tell a lie!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.07,1:08:25.57,ENG,1171,0,0,0,,What should I say?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.68,1:08:26.97,ENG,1172,0,0,0,,Anything, but quick!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.97,1:08:29.47,ENG,1173,0,0,0,,Say something crazy like "I'm wearing ladies' underwear!"
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.67,1:08:32.48,ENG,1174,0,0,0,,I am wearing ladies' underwear.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.07,1:08:36.97,ENG,1175,0,0,0,,Are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.08,1:08:38.67,ENG,1176,0,0,0,,I most certainly am not!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.78,1:08:41.78,ENG,1177,0,0,0,,It looks like you most certainly am are!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.88,1:08:42.79,ENG,1178,0,0,0,,I am not!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.88,1:08:43.68,ENG,1179,0,0,0,,What kind?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.79,1:08:45.97,ENG,1180,0,0,0,,It's a thong!!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.97,1:08:46.68,ENG,1181,0,0,0,,Oww! They're briefs
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.68,1:08:47.68,ENG,1182,0,0,0,,-  Are not. - Are too!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.68,1:08:49.37,ENG,1183,0,0,0,,-  Are not! - Are too!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.38,1:08:51.67,ENG,1184,0,0,0,,Here we go. Hang tight.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.58,1:08:58.17,ENG,1185,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.67,1:09:03.07,ENG,1186,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.18,1:09:03.97,ENG,1187,0,0,0,,Puss!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.98,1:09:06.17,ENG,1188,0,0,0,,Pardon me, would you mind letting me go?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.47,1:09:07.38,ENG,1189,0,0,0,,Sorry, boss.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.47,1:09:10.08,ENG,1190,0,0,0,,Quit messing around! We've got to stop that kiss!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.08,1:09:12.17,ENG,1191,0,0,0,,I thought you was going to let her go.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.17,1:09:14.68,ENG,1192,0,0,0,,I was, but I can't let them do this to Fiona.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.68,1:09:15.68,ENG,1193,0,0,0,,Boom! That's what I like to hear.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.68,1:09:17.68,ENG,1194,0,0,0,,Look who's coming around!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.89,1:09:19.67,ENG,1195,0,0,0,,It's impossible! We'll never get in.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.67,1:09:21.68,ENG,1196,0,0,0,,The castle's guarded. There's a moat and everything!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.07,1:09:27.28,ENG,1197,0,0,0,,Folks, it looks like we're up chocolate creek without a Popsicle stick.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.28,1:09:28.67,ENG,1198,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.89,1:09:34.69,ENG,1199,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.69,1:09:36.48,ENG,1200,0,0,0,,Do you still know the Muffin Man?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.67,1:09:39.18,ENG,1201,0,0,0,,Well, sure! He's down on Drury Lane.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.48,1:09:40.48,ENG,1202,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.58,1:09:45.69,ENG,1203,0,0,0,,Because we're gonna need flour.  Lots and lots of flour.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.87,1:09:50.28,ENG,1204,0,0,0,,Gingy!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.48,1:09:52.68,ENG,1205,0,0,0,,Fire up the ovens, Muffin Man!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.68,1:09:55.18,ENG,1206,0,0,0,,We've got a big order to fill!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.28,1:10:01.37,ENG,1207,0,0,0,,It's alive!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.17,1:10:05.18,ENG,1208,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.29,1:10:14.09,ENG,1209,0,0,0,,Run, run, run, as fast you can!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.07,1:10:22.78,ENG,1210,0,0,0,,Go, baby, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.29,1:10:27.18,ENG,1211,0,0,0,,There it is, Mongo! To the castle!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.69,1:10:30.49,ENG,1212,0,0,0,,No, you great stupid pastry!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.69,1:10:31.69,ENG,1213,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.58,1:10:42.18,ENG,1214,0,0,0,,Mongo! Down here! Look at the pony!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.48,1:10:46.18,ENG,1215,0,0,0,,That's right! Follow the pretty pony!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.18,1:10:48.17,ENG,1216,0,0,0,,Pretty pony wants to play at the castle!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.48,1:10:50.18,ENG,1217,0,0,0,,Pretty pony.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.77,1:10:55.98,ENG,1218,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen. Presenting Princess Fiona
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.09,1:10:59.19,ENG,1219,0,0,0,,and her new husband, Prince Shrek.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.19,1:11:03.29,ENG,1220,0,0,0,,Shrek, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.39,1:11:06.28,ENG,1221,0,0,0,,I'm just playing the part, Fiona.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.38,1:11:08.68,ENG,1222,0,0,0,,Is that glitter on your lips?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.88,1:11:11.48,ENG,1223,0,0,0,,Mm. Cherry flavored. Want to taste?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.38,1:11:13.99,ENG,1224,0,0,0,,Ugh! What is with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.09,1:11:15.59,ENG,1225,0,0,0,,But, Muffin Cake...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.89,1:11:21.29,ENG,1226,0,0,0,,C Minor, put it in C Minor.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.69,1:11:23.19,ENG,1227,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.68,1:11:28.49,ENG,1228,0,0,0,,I'd like to dedicate this song to...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.58,1:11:30.49,ENG,1229,0,0,0,,Princess Fiona
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.68,1:11:32.69,ENG,1230,0,0,0,,and Prince Shrek.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.09,1:11:35.69,ENG,1231,0,0,0,,Fiona, my Princess.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.69,1:11:38.19,ENG,1232,0,0,0,,Will you honor me with a dance?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.29,1:11:42.58,ENG,1233,0,0,0,,∮ Where have all the good men gone ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.67,1:11:46.18,ENG,1234,0,0,0,,∮ And where are all the gods? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.88,1:11:54.68,ENG,1235,0,0,0,,∮ Where's the streetwise Hercules ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.69,1:11:57.18,ENG,1236,0,0,0,,∮ To fight the rising odds? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.49,1:11:59.08,ENG,1237,0,0,0,,Since when do you dance?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.28,1:12:03.08,ENG,1238,0,0,0,,Fiona, my dearest, if there's one thing I know,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.18,1:12:05.10,ENG,1239,0,0,0,,it's that love is full of surprises.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.19,1:12:14.19,ENG,1240,0,0,0,,∮ Late at night I toss and I turn And I dream of what I need ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.29,1:12:17.29,ENG,1241,0,0,0,,Hit it!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.59,1:12:21.49,ENG,1242,0,0,0,,∮ I need a Hero... ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.69,1:12:25.89,ENG,1243,0,0,0,,All right, big fella! Let's crash this party!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.69,1:12:28.29,ENG,1244,0,0,0,,Man the catapults!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.28,1:12:31.48,ENG,1245,0,0,0,,Aim! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.88,1:12:35.99,ENG,1246,0,0,0,,Brace yourselves! Ooh! Purty!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.00,1:12:45.79,ENG,1247,0,0,0,,Not the gumdrop button!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.99,1:12:53.89,ENG,1248,0,0,0,,Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.40,1:12:56.30,ENG,1249,0,0,0,,Ha-ha! All right!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.10,1:13:04.30,ENG,1250,0,0,0,,∮ Somewhere after midnight In my wildest fantasy ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.30,1:13:06.50,ENG,1251,0,0,0,,Go, Mongo! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.19,1:13:12.39,ENG,1252,0,0,0,,Man the cauldrons!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.09,1:13:19.40,ENG,1253,0,0,0,,After you, Mongo.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.99,1:13:24.70,ENG,1254,0,0,0,,That's it! Heave-ho!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.29,1:13:26.69,ENG,1255,0,0,0,,Watch out! Shrek!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.90,1:13:35.89,ENG,1256,0,0,0,,More heat, less foam!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.89,1:13:38.90,ENG,1257,0,0,0,,∮ Up where the mountains Meet the heavens above ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.90,1:13:41.99,ENG,1258,0,0,0,,∮ Out where the lightning Splits the sea ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.10,1:13:47.00,ENG,1259,0,0,0,,∮ I could swear there is someone Somewhere watching me ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.00,1:13:49.60,ENG,1260,0,0,0,,Heave! Ho!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.40,1:13:58.19,ENG,1261,0,0,0,,No...!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.30,1:14:29.30,ENG,1262,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.50,1:14:31.60,ENG,1263,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.70,1:14:35.39,ENG,1264,0,0,0,,Be good.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.69,1:14:39.20,ENG,1265,0,0,0,,He needs me! Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.60,1:14:44.30,ENG,1266,0,0,0,,Donkey!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.40,1:14:54.20,ENG,1267,0,0,0,,Puss!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.89,1:15:00.40,ENG,1268,0,0,0,,Go! Go! Your lady needs you! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.40,1:15:06.19,ENG,1269,0,0,0,,Today, I repay my debt.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.90,1:15:16.50,ENG,1270,0,0,0,,On guard!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.70,1:15:22.99,ENG,1271,0,0,0,,∮ He's gotta be strong And he's gotta be fast ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.20,1:15:25.80,ENG,1272,0,0,0,,∮ And he's gotta be fresh From the fight ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.31,1:15:27.70,ENG,1273,0,0,0,,∮ I need a Hero... ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.70,1:15:28.91,ENG,1274,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.10,1:15:37.31,ENG,1275,0,0,0,,Hey, you! Back away from my wife.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.50,1:15:38.40,ENG,1276,0,0,0,,Shrek?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.51,1:15:42.71,ENG,1277,0,0,0,,You couldn't just go back to your swamp
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.71,1:15:43.71,ENG,1278,0,0,0,,and leave well enough alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.71,1:15:45.90,ENG,1279,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.90,1:15:47.90,ENG,1280,0,0,0,,Pigs und blanket!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.50,1:15:50.71,ENG,1281,0,0,0,,Pinocchio! Get the wand!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.71,1:15:52.71,ENG,1282,0,0,0,,I see London! I see France!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.70,1:15:58.20,ENG,1283,0,0,0,,I'm a real boy!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.51,1:16:09.51,ENG,1284,0,0,0,,Catch!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.21,1:16:11.50,ENG,1285,0,0,0,,Donkey!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.89,1:16:17.70,ENG,1286,0,0,0,,I'm a real boy. Aah!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.51,1:16:23.01,ENG,1287,0,0,0,,That's mine!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.21,1:16:29.11,ENG,1288,0,0,0,,Pray for mercy, from Puss...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.11,1:16:30.21,ENG,1289,0,0,0,,And Donkey!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.51,1:16:33.20,ENG,1290,0,0,0,,She's taken the potion! Kiss her now!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.71,1:16:37.61,ENG,1291,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.31,1:17:01.11,ENG,1292,0,0,0,,Fiona.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.21,1:17:02.42,ENG,1293,0,0,0,,Shrek.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.42,1:17:06.31,ENG,1294,0,0,0,,Harold! You were supposed to give her the potion!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.51,1:17:10.51,ENG,1295,0,0,0,,Well, I guess I gave her the wrong tea.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.62,1:17:11.51,ENG,1296,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.62,1:17:12.52,ENG,1297,0,0,0,,Mommy?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.51,1:17:20.32,ENG,1298,0,0,0,,I told you. Ogres don't live happily ever after.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.52,1:17:45.52,ENG,1299,0,0,0,,Oh, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.52,1:17:47.52,ENG,1300,0,0,0,,Harold
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.72,1:17:51.41,ENG,1301,0,0,0,,-  Is he...? - Yup.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.01,1:17:55.22,ENG,1302,0,0,0,,He croaked.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.01,1:17:58.21,ENG,1303,0,0,0,,Harold?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.21,1:17:59.21,ENG,1304,0,0,0,,Dad?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.21,1:18:02.72,ENG,1305,0,0,0,,I'd hoped you'd never see me like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.72,1:18:04.92,ENG,1306,0,0,0,,-  And he gave you a hard time! - Donkey!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.22,1:18:07.31,ENG,1307,0,0,0,,No, no, he's right. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.42,1:18:12.82,ENG,1308,0,0,0,,To both of you.I only wanted what was best for Fiona.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.41,1:18:17.32,ENG,1309,0,0,0,,But I can see now...she already has it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.82,1:18:20.91,ENG,1310,0,0,0,,Shrek, Fiona...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.01,1:18:24.92,ENG,1311,0,0,0,,Will you accept an old frog's apologies...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.41,1:18:27.01,ENG,1312,0,0,0,,and my blessing?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.31,1:18:29.32,ENG,1313,0,0,0,,Harold?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.41,1:18:34.01,ENG,1314,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Lillian.I just wish I could be the man you deserve.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.82,1:18:39.43,ENG,1315,0,0,0,,You're more that man today than you ever were...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.82,1:18:41.13,ENG,1316,0,0,0,,warts and all.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.71,1:18:47.51,ENG,1317,0,0,0,,Boss! The Happily Ever After Potion!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.51,1:18:49.32,ENG,1318,0,0,0,,Midnight!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.52,1:18:52.52,ENG,1319,0,0,0,,Fiona. Is this what you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.33,1:18:56.23,ENG,1320,0,0,0,,- To be this way forever?- What?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.32,1:19:01.11,ENG,1321,0,0,0,,Because if you kiss me now...we can stay like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.62,1:19:04.62,ENG,1322,0,0,0,,You'd do that... For me?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.11,1:19:06.22,ENG,1323,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.72,1:19:20.51,ENG,1324,0,0,0,,I want what any princess wants.To live happily ever after...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.42,1:19:27.42,ENG,1325,0,0,0,,with the ogre I married.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.92,1:19:32.92,ENG,1326,0,0,0,,Whatever happens, I must not cry!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.03,1:19:35.72,ENG,1327,0,0,0,,You cannot make me cry!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.62,1:20:02.31,ENG,1328,0,0,0,,No. No, no. Aaah! Ow.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.63,1:20:29.72,ENG,1329,0,0,0,,Hey. You still look like a noble steed to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.02,1:20:36.63,ENG,1330,0,0,0,,Now, where were we?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.63,1:20:38.93,ENG,1331,0,0,0,,Oh. I remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.72,1:20:49.23,ENG,1332,0,0,0,,Hey! Isn't we supposed to be having a fiesta?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.23,1:20:51.23,ENG,1333,0,0,0,,Uno, dos, quatro,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.23,1:20:52.73,ENG,1334,0,0,0,,hit it!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.72,1:20:58.83,ENG,1335,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.92,1:21:00.42,ENG,1336,0,0,0,,Puss and Donkey, y'all...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.53,1:21:03.23,ENG,1337,0,0,0,,∮ She's into superstitions ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.33,1:21:05.92,ENG,1338,0,0,0,,∮ Black cats and voodoo dolls ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.02,1:21:08.73,ENG,1339,0,0,0,,-  Sing it, Puss! -  ∮ I feel a premonition ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.73,1:21:11.23,ENG,1340,0,0,0,,∮ That girl's gonna make me fall ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.82,1:21:13.83,ENG,1341,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.93,1:21:16.73,ENG,1342,0,0,0,,∮ She's into new sensations ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.73,1:21:19.23,ENG,1343,0,0,0,,∮ New kicks in the candlelight ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.23,1:21:21.93,ENG,1344,0,0,0,,∮ She's got a new addiction ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.03,1:21:24.42,ENG,1345,0,0,0,,∮ For every day and night ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.53,1:21:26.73,ENG,1346,0,0,0,,∮ She'll make you take your clothes off ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.84,1:21:30.04,ENG,1347,0,0,0,,∮ And go dancing in the rain ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.13,1:21:32.14,ENG,1348,0,0,0,,∮ She'll make you live her crazy life ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.24,1:21:34.73,ENG,1349,0,0,0,,∮ But she'll take away your pain ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.84,1:21:38.24,ENG,1350,0,0,0,,∮ Like a bullet to your brain ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.33,1:21:40.82,ENG,1351,0,0,0,,∮ Upside inside out ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.93,1:21:43.23,ENG,1352,0,0,0,,∮ Living la vida loca ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.93,1:21:46.33,ENG,1353,0,0,0,,Hey gorgeous!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.33,1:21:49.03,ENG,1354,0,0,0,,∮ Living la vida loca ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.03,1:21:51.43,ENG,1355,0,0,0,,∮ Her lips are devil red ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.43,1:21:53.82,ENG,1356,0,0,0,,∮ And her skin's the color of mocha ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.92,1:21:56.83,ENG,1357,0,0,0,,∮ She will wear you out ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.93,1:21:59.63,ENG,1358,0,0,0,,∮ Living la vida loc. Oh! She livin' it loca! ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.63,1:22:01.14,ENG,1359,0,0,0,,∮ Living la vida loca ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.24,1:22:04.93,ENG,1360,0,0,0,,- Say it one more time now! - ∮ Living the vida loca ∮
